><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R3" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">4</div></th><td class="s10">Assassin&#39;s Cowl</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaEQ9G3TYhFqgEFl3ABXss0wNweQsLkdz4oPvku5ly4DwXIOTiZUMQwvc7NKlnjBUKHz8WWXeiuEBCbTkulig1RK89j5ZzyCjFKYnVtGVMsmhoADiDqGoG4A_REOzTpPZFAtTAZSVjAJY8smcGyDHxMITc9UxYJnOpy=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s12" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Powered Melee Kill </span><span style="font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Finisher</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Void Invisibility</span><span style="color:#d9d2e9;"> </span>and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores 67 Health</span>.<br>(Finishers) increase the duration of the <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Void Invisibility</span> by +3 seconds.<br><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"><br>Invisibility Duration </span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;"><br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Minor </span>=<span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> 7 seconds (10)</span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;"><br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite </span>| <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardian </span>=<span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> 10 seconds (13)</span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;"><br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Miniboss+</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span>= <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">13 seconds (16)</span></td><td class="s13">Abeyant Leap</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xU1gpakqsjOZqTeIHMeANCe6vchYtt4WG6MDQWM7ZIRMum5GanUoeEUkS7EN1bbeygSSvUJxW-2jPTBQ0iyhREA1JO2IvnCAOkRMk79SJNzJei6K40grtEqbqdWTo6hVYnGfptVn5kOrcZZczWsWIu5iLHN_RN5cFj9x6A=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s15" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#63d275;">Enhances Drengr&#39;s Lash.<br></span><span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspension </span>inflicted by <span style="color:#63d275;">Drengr&#39;s Lash</span> last +3 seconds longer.<br><span style="color:#63d275;">Drengr&#39;s Lash </span><span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspension </span>on <span style="color:#ea9999;">Minibosses </span>last +2 seconds longer<br><span style="color:#63d275;"><br></span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Barricade:<br></span>Creates 2 additional <span style="color:#63d275;">Lashes.</span><span style="color:#93c47d;"><br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Lashes </span>now seek enemies more aggressively and travel 16.7% (5 meters) farther.<br><br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Thruster:<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Knot </span>lasts up to ? seconds, lobbing itself towards enemies within ? meters, and detonates on contact.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon inflicting </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6aa84f;">Suspension</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#93c47d;">Woven Mail</span> for 10 seconds.</td><td class="s16">Apotheosis Veil</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLavxnfuZk17PYnQviDYhdp3-yP6iuT1tjX18BuRA2anakrY8G7hcHfRNGbby41jcDbjc_sHnDxyKRxmAiNTal8iSe_RtigyCV7YT-eBJajPO2887nGI8cH6ej78lLePYdB36xRRZkc3Jpz055ZCUol3ONQkbZomSzqF=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s17" rowspan="3"><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Cast</span><span style="font-style:italic;">, for the </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Caster </span><span style="font-style:italic;">and </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Allies </span><span style="font-style:italic;">within ? meters.<br></span>Fully restores <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Health</span>, <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade</span>, <span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Melee</span>, and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span>Ability Energy.<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super End</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants 66% Fixed Bonus <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span>and <span style="color:#79bec3;">Melee </span>Ability Energy per second for 8 seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R4" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">5</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVrOb7t81uAKWcIAvxbUmeRTV1-h9iL1CSvacSDhIgyRo7OUnpXl6dI4WnKoYtrXwvujv2rv3F08ozWFxJHotCJMPmXDJR0wnE4pyPWkFpqcB2yfb3L_GSHGec9QDQjyCPgosqPk5ajJC0LtxF2EmCAXdvhlPfHcBwoPi8=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLY11H0HRh4rDr1fRp6MuDrHR_zlsSTPT_EuCF8v3y7LuTUEmUmwn0hwYVMUt215uQmm61SmGWUYqrZ1RJFc4f49U22ZEnfi3hi_raQ1BR-WJv-r-D0x8SkCEa0lD5IQ-NiOa15Z_pF1uyEYugljsVvPcKdd-CK3iJrl=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbeyvbx8Bs-YFVH4YWlD9s59y_IOY1ogqTLOEuekNBFkgNr89Yg9CZib0TN5mea-NAqtwhicqPTBj5nqfjv3SEwYdzlGQclrM-Z14EvZFVXiH4Eh3rrVFxIgCUOWG4p0JDZpw7esWlRTuvYY50g-lFrl8r7p0Hn0WRC=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R5" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">6</div></th><td class="s21">Vanishing Execution</td><td class="s22">Puppeteer&#39;s Control</td><td class="s23">Insatiable</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R6" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">7</div></th><td class="s24">Athrys&#39;s Embrace</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZtHhObNq_mTadl2gdHTp75GHuAxFzVWUoqoiBDMPWE8YALfv5-kW-iOOKTJ9NRdKVgFbMbE15vMGTlxM4wVU6eEJaLuOo6aYxuN1V4hREbMW0sR_uYsLz35rUUJl07xPt8zMBjqQLj67fqkYge5Li2_Jx7g1ANG7i5=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Weighted Throwing Knives</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> are equipped:<br><br></span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Weighted Throwing Knives</span> gain a second bounce with greatly increased tracking.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">3 Precision Hits</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">2.5 seconds </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of each</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#f1c232;"> </span>Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Strengthened Throwing Knife </span>for 10 seconds.<span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span>Scoring additional <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Hits</span><span style="color:#f3f3f3;"> </span>extends the buff duration by 5 seconds, up to 30 seconds.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Strengthened Throwing Knife:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">300%</span><span style="color:#4a86e8;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[100%]</span><span style="color:#e84a4a;"> </span>increased <span style="color:#e0a261;">Weighted Throwing Knife</span> damage and <span style="color:#89cdd1;">+50 Melee Stat</span> while active.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Stuns </span><span style="color:#c67676;">Unstoppable Champions </span>on hit.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Buff is consumed on hit.</span></td><td class="s26">ACD/0 Feedback Fence</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLauXrLJFzXtG_bJ79cEG7KO34isTJz2rkh7BCfqH4l0jRnAOC-lqahHIs05v7IyBFv7JuMqCJgKLd_Zol4nyfNeBDVBioGXtvLERpgBN_ccu2h4w2247hrssoDiM_Alf4qJirwqDrWz6V1M9DBj_jD0MLyskxGS7UO9=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Hits</span><span style="color:#79bec3;"> </span>grant a stack of <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Armor Charge</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Armor Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is active:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Melee Damage Resist against Combatants</span>.<br>Being struck by a <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Attack</span> triggers an <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Burst</span>, <span style="color:#ccae3b;">consuming </span>all <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Armor Charges</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Burst</span> inflicts <span style="color:#76a5af;">Jolt </span>and deals <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Damage</span> in a ? radius.<br><br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Burst:<br>90 | 130 | 170 | 200 | 225 | 245 Arc Damage</span><span style="color:#a2c4c9;"><br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">23.3% | 46.7% | 70% | 73.3% | 76.7% | 80% Melee Damage Resist against Combatants</span></td><td class="s28">Astrocyte Verse</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbw2eDpWthp9joBBPFgCP41RoRLOb5iTzdVsSmOd7Gr5aA7Hs7fPp81GDKId4NcqRT-d41SnL_HIR15xJqPA17n8Nv-rzd6k2hVjwq1EDOeHPb43G4CK9trMUIN51hB0aC6kYYJ5iay8xnJuieBtOSN5VqXGcU9Z15P=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s29" rowspan="3">Passively grants +30 Airborne Effectiveness and enhances <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Blink</span>.<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Blink </span><span style="font-style:italic;">is equipped, either on </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Void </span><span style="font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#fbbdec;">Prismatic </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Subclasses:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span>Grants a free horizontal <span style="color:#ffd966;">Dark Blink usage</span> with [Air Move] every <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">6</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[8]</span> seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Dark Blink </span>releases <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">4</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[2]</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> Seekers</span> that are functionally identical to <span style="color:#ffd966;">Nova Warp&#39;s</span> and scale with <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Damage</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">25% Increased Blink Distance.<br>20% Decreased Cooldown for Blink Charges</span>. (3.55 -&gt; 2.85 seconds for both charges)<br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Time between blinks</span> is decreased by 30% (1.65 -&gt; 1.15 seconds)  <br><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">On Blink/</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Dark Blink</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;"> Activation:<br></span>Inflicts <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Volatile</span> to enemies within 10 metres.<br>Grants <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Volatile Rounds</span> for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">9</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[5]</span> seconds.<br>+100 Handling for 2 seconds. Stowing cancels the effect.<br>Radar remains active.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">During </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Nova Warp Super</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Dark Blink</span> does not consume <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Energy</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R7" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">8</div></th><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWJ2OQf3oGSz26L0oUN_D53EJnzXpOhoc33H_PLi8x7qIAutMc24wEL9kK5hjo9gxKLmXhXrRnqbHK0qNniS3XMr-7fAOhcBSQF0ifspax0hbkldyq2TPM_dfITKzdk2OzVXPSdSNQUvP91alzULfuhagNbxJCRtAc55Q=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUrDaiqjco_HXtxQZxyeK2JpmJQAxtuewZV2V1o2PKWW8Riw0Y2jrLedUkw5z9QOSlezeKofXXXoHb1PXleL2gF3QfH6bAmoI_nlewv-PiXRFR27l0-snHObLtZ-P3I_j7_Oy6RBSV6feCWp8T3PfPSYWfJcz6CivWCAS0=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYLku6zpmjARy7-gm8Es4eQ2k1sHG-SfnBU8xYR7vMudZ7