a6p_75Uy9FGXzpjgshBSw79dZJrZ0RgjpqCqHo8MjwdjS_HrwpfLxoApMBPrGfynycQuq2ulex1d8TqOxSFzkxPlObyRE=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s44" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While in </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Arc Staff</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"> Super</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">:<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Blocking </span>doesn&#39;t consume any extra<span style="color:#fdd24d;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Energy.<br>Reflected Projectiles </span>deal 400% increased damage.<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">(10x base damage against Combatants)</span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Reflecting Projectiles</span> grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">?% Super Energy</span>.<br><br>Can deactivate <span style="color:#ffd966;">Arc Staff</span> at any time to preserve a portion of <span style="color:#ffd966;">unspent Super Energy</span>.<br>Deactivation refunds up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">75% of unspent Super Energy</span> at <span style="color:#ffd966;">100% Super Energy</span>, down to <span style="color:#ffd966;">50% of unspent Super Energy</span> at <span style="color:#ffd966;">0% Super Energy</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Arc Staff deactivation</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Triggers an <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Explosion</span>, dealing scaling damage based on the amount of <span style="color:#ffd966;">reflected projectiles</span> and <span style="color:#999999;">blinding </span>enemies within 10 meters.<br>Deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">675 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> damage at base, up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">2,700 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> damage after <span style="color:#ffd966;">reflecting MANY projectiles</span>.<br>Grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">x4 Arc Weapon Surge</span> for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">21 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[16]</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Blinding Burst Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> has no falloff.</span></td><td class="s26">An Insurmountable Skullfort</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZhUM0FEtr9wH9tpquDBnCa4fUHr04g9oUH2QSkS1AFD6rK0e4Xcn9od9IKpTSefW70wsFMKhAG87xDm084VSTg8kFadLxbPQF94irpPTogWKQrbTdDyncPbPdwV1zKcAmq9KSA9g1rw9q39sNiflavIRI1NQ1hSsIR=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Powered Arc Melee Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#79bec3;">100% Melee Ability Energy </span>and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">begins Health Regeneration.<br><br></span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Hits</span> grant <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Melee Ability Energy</span>, up to once per melee.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">50% Melee Ability Energy</span> on <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Powered Melee Hit</span>.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">15% Melee Ability Energy</span> on <span style="color:#e06666;">Non-Glaive</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> Melee Hit</span> while <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Knockout</span> is active.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">5% Melee Ability Energy</span> on <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Basic</span>/<span style="color:#89cdd1;">Glaive Melee Hit</span>.</td><td class="s16">Boots of the Assembler</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb2I_WfCoVOWkZQ_pDeWtbw4frnWwfFkU7yvhRBvScGFMCK7v2tMob2RReH65KgMYs35e8Y9w221es7T5bF4M_oeqwglp1knRdoxA8ZwEsmc-d-dTJ_IHHs_hKgR2KVOa_AcGvu82TWeTEDafBLo66T1aU3aRO37mU3=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s45" rowspan="3">Passively grants +30 Airborne Effectiveness to <span style="color:#ffd966;">Lumina</span>. <span style="color:#c9daf8;">Noble Seekers</span> grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">Noble Rounds</span> to <span style="color:#ffd966;">Lumina</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While standing in a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Rift </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Well of Radiance</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;"><br></span>Spawns <span style="color:#ffd966;">Noble Seekers</span> at an average rate of <span style="color:#ffd966;">1</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> per Fireteam-member </span>every 8 seconds.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Noble Seekers:<br></span>Track <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>within 40 metres and bestow a buff on close proximity.<br><span style="color:#93c47d;">Prioritize </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>who have not been <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">healed</span> in the last 8s and <span style="color:#e06666;">won&#39;t target</span> an <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">ally </span>more than once every 4s.<br> <br><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Healing Rift | </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Seekers </span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restore 70 Health, </span><span style="color:#7cadff;">60 Shield</span>,<span style="color:#dd7e6b;"> </span>and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">begin Health Regeneration.<br></span><span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Empowering Rift</span><span style="color:#cfe2f3;"> | </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Seekers </span>grant <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">35%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [15%] </span>increased damage and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">+100 Class</span> for 5 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Well of Radiance Seekers grant both effects.<br></span><br>Grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Fireteam-Based</span> <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Energy</span> upon buffing an <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">ally </span>with a <span style="color:#ffd966;">Seeker</span>.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">2 Allies</span> = <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">?% Class Ability Energy</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">3</span> = <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">25?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">4</span> = <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">5</span> = <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">?%</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R13" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">14</div></th><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUod7yaPqt3C8ODVyIQdmElX0UyhjhLU421EwfLlew5qOPnBT7lA1mONhmY2IvqgFzpjvBjyQJOp4QI6CUNx8PE2ul2hipf_AOoABboC9iIVbmFQN073wPZYXe6krta8V7IumWfV9pMJxwUhRIUw_A8Mjd8CIKUuYNMEw=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYrtuGZ517u3Dur1iKfcHi-xv2TZRACefHDZbYw8FJ8yb8xVUlV6SiJxCfzsWWHbv9rEGBUHMEYvRgt_TFw7gASatOv4U_DDQOmr0chDmscs74ZkKQgvvpsZ