<span style="font-weight:normal;">. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Detonates instantly on contact with surface or enemy.</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><br><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Parting Gift</span> has an additional effect based on the equipped <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super</span>:<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc:</span> <span style="color:#999999;">Blind </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">for </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[3] </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">seconds.</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#c67676;"><br></span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Solar: x40</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+20</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Scorch.<br></span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void: </span><span style="color:#8e7cc3;">Suppress </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">for</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="color:#8e7cc3;">10</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">seconds </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[Does not apply to Guardians in Super]</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"><br></span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis: </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">x40</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[x20]</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> Slow for </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">4</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#6fa8dc;">+4</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[1.5</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#6fa8dc;">+0.5</span><span style="color:#ea9999;">]</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> seconds.<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Strand:</span><span style="color:#93c47d;"> </span><span style="color:#6aa84f;">Severs </span><span style="color:#63d275;">for ? seconds.</span></td><td class="s36">Antaeus Wards</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"