t-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants increased <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Void Soul</span> damage and Damage Resist. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Bonuses can be maintained by redeploying.<br></span><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Void Soul</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> Benefits:<br></span>25% | 50% | 75% | 100% increased damage.<br>12.5% | 25% | 37.5% | 50% Damage Resist.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R16" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">17</div></th><td class="s49"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXUQ8Oz_-_zOl_HJGjCugBUUEG1JQk7XenWDyGBCAa9RoBS4MTE__cl-Aqvoy7BE1KLlxHuNJe6_PWMZsVsC6SwEiLHO7LIrnkUacb5p7cRwCXji94hJ9o-8ihxBggqpxS_dP2yFNPtv0YisE26nSMLDwwXX5OhBN9rmeI=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVW1NG_3W5IJjzEw0PwhtAt62H6iA45B8gFHM1mCj_nPd6dH0Ub0-L19hz0-mpB2tO77rgnk1mVM629HII2TwKgjtaMu-l30IDvRAsMrpEmjwIUl6_Cl9cf48-vAkr5L_df0dGJ4rD1gZpLqdmAVCCCodeNkS_MqEBWS9A=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWna9ECjrhdcatspvoPctxCNIFIiDEV9tZo0FYSuNx8FfKikMNHkw6MvQwxxV0QZSwX5BKxfDvzVNH1VDVDjP_gRXysLFdhtinAbqQNpu8SkVYkvHur72CYN5UjvcNpFWO_cTbNGnt9MeE2jUIATMHe1aIUbHDIlpiihGg=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R17" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">18</div></th><td class="s50">Parting Gift</td><td class="s42">Reflective Vents</td><td class="s35">One with the Void</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R18" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">19</div></th><td class="s24">Caliban&#39;s Hand</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUT25jU-4jYm6wKgwUcf2_QT2FE7YGO6hh4bmEWID6c1EowHlk-wEGJ2OoT5pK-CytOVyW2IjQ7_Ki9QQPUWah0RIP8rCqM-7W45C571S4K1Iyw5glr5cRetJkgb6H7K2dmTcLt7YeudLPBRleCDSrtRGsEokCUPxIuv2I=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Proximity Explosive Knife</span> inflicts <span style="color:#f6b26b;">x60</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+0</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Scorch</span> on detonation. <br><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Proximity Explosive Knife</span> kills trigger an <span style="color:#e69138;">ignition.</span><br><br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">625%? Additional Base Melee Recharge Rate</span> while <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Proximity Knife</span> remains unexploded.<br><br><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Scorch </span>grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">7%</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?%] </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Ability Energy</span> per tick.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Reminder that Proximity Knife has a 0.7x Chunk Scalar.</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"><br></span><br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Ignitions Kills</span> grant a<span style="color:#89cdd1;"> Melee Ability Charge</span>.<br>Can <span style="color:#89cdd1;">overflow </span>up to <span style="color:#89cdd1;">+1 Melee Charges</span> for <span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar Knives</span> and <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Withering Blades</span>.<br><span style="color:#fbbdec;">While on Prismatic</span>, can <span style="color:#89cdd1;">overflow </span>up to <span style="color:#89cdd1;">+2</span> for <span style="color:#e0a261;">Knife Trick</span> and <span style="color:#7cadff;">Withering Blades</span>.</td><td class="s36">Arbor Warden</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUj9QAhC3ukDOr-6RulpDf5qllC6fA8qOtKI4_xPIdwgQ6LV0On-sCjDsP7R0XWcDz203mAxpOF5Y3lrlsEP6opMjYbDomKsfEGa5QSBfbBB127lhvul6K2nMEIOelXDr5MzA5WGXAi6IPEbdnMvNnnMevREQuR2u6tGQ=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s51" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Overwrites Barricade Cooldown</span> to <span style="color:#85cab7;">pre-EoF</span> versions, resulting in <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">~1.45x Class Ability Regeneration Speed</span>.<br><span style="color:#e06666;">Towering </span>= 101s -&gt; 70s | <span style="color:#e06666;">Rally </span>= 55s -&gt; 38s<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Replaces <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability</span> with <span style="color:#ffd966;">Barri-Nade</span>. <br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Barri-Nade</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> is lost if </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> fully recharges.</span><br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Barri-Nade </span>spawns a <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Barricade </span>on impact. <br>Enemies that are within 5 metres of impact are disoriented. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Barricade </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">does not deal Contact Damage within 2 seconds of it being created.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Barricade Type</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> uses selected </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Barricade </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">and inherits Aspects such as </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#8e7cc3;">Bastion </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">and </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;">Lash.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Non-Barricades default to Towering Barricade and its respective cooldown.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After picking up </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">3</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">[?]</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"> Orbs of Power</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Enhances Barri-Nade</span>, creating <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">3 Barricades</span> in a ◯ formation, spread out 120 degrees.<br>Rally are placed close together, while Towering are placed spread out.</td><td class="s16">Cenotaph Mask</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVzLACot_Vd4ePk2bNco3F8REJcSTuYXzqgliB_GWOFsPtlw6tm1m1HRk5BtQ73W63x11V9LMmjL610J602c9XmkJAgDbzA-VS6Cc1R6gav1Q13FmgtYqHus5sKNclm6MjSvXzt-oQq30sS44AV5Z_uwnr1ZAmI4ALb3Ts=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s17" rowspan="3">Trace Rifles refill 4% of their Magazine every 0.7 seconds. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Works while stowed.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br>Upon scoring 5 Trace Rifle hits within ? seconds of each on a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Miniboss, Champion, Boss, or Vehicle</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Combatant </span>is <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">marked</span> for 10 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Additional Trace Rifle Hits refresh the duration of the </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">mark</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br></span><br>On <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Marked Enemy Death</span> by <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Ally</span>:<br>Generates <span style="color:#a481e1;">Heavy Ammo</span> for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies</span>.<br>Generates <span style="color:#93c47d;">Special Ammo</span> for <span style="color:#ffd966;">wearer</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Cenotaph Ammo Bricks </span>grant 10% of Total Reserves and are affected by Scavenger mods.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R19" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">20</div></th><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbsdKWNci-HEo7v6xrCqVh5cv4W9qr6CEAET23Bd4Q_h-rHZtXL7bZBj2HnLurzu5RgIu81YTkoBCKN1qddsNA6-jwFyJ6Vki0C5yaJVhFopjUkBX2CZ5dxxdbvzcuqhvtxPf3GTCS3aiAdtK5M73uVeruxSLLEOCGI=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xW-9hO4D4r-iXaPA2Enrvrv2IJCxFtFaBfNJX1lrvrH6MBamEe6NdW52Z2tRbYeiUBTlXKa3kA0yJ09CAW60zIodNVkjLYeVlUSRd_G0_3YkDynqYlQbOM75_ksMc5qq8WUutFsYSrIZEzd--qfEPkzoDf15OS9wOWV4A=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXCXvJgqQ-68EliEnhgmdY1hq5TsC6OoxWLDFe0VrYSlWCDBFcWvdVCFhSVMaynrUDu8AIEzih13LsF2_iDZJ_iMWVTpUpPv9Ot11hMox4RzmBiV9Aa7nDe26qhv0W91CPRA6gSNCQBjBfoGf2ApTMS7v9RedP67S6tJ2w=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R20" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">21</div></th><td class="s33">Roast &#39;Em</td><td class="s42">Barri-nade</td><td class="s23">High Priority</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R21" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">22</div></th><td class="s24">Celestial Nighthawk</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYWLT0Yyn74SzY5JVGXOfxMiNKno31OkbVjYek4A55D_2CwG9UTneoUVbGVf3XGUSomhyuvGzQB0uULsEeQVzHqt8bkepXeZ-p4LotdiMne8cDnPh7umGQxqqfWQ3ALJ3p3Lhl9uGJ2mf1LtDFT7rQRu_RPBFYcLtvN=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s52" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#ffd966;">Replaces Golden Gun with a modified single high-damage shot version.<br>Golden Gun Supers no longer receive Roaming Super Ability Regeneration.<br><br>Modified Golden Gun:<br></span>Deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">12,984 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Damage</span> with a <span style="color:#f1c232;">2x Precision Multiplier</span>. Triggers an <span style="color:#ff9900;">ignition </span>on hit.<br><span style="color:#ff9900;">Ignition damage</span> overrides other sources, always dealing 10% increased damage.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(85% more damage on Precision Hit compared to </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">3 Precision Hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">+</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ff9900;">Ignition </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">from Base </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Marksman Golden Gun</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">).</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"><br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Golden Gun Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refunds <span style="color:#ffd966;">33% Super Energy <br></span>Enemy <span style="color:#e0a261;">explodes</span>, dealing up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">400</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Damage </span>to enemies within ? metres.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill:<br></span>Grants additional <span style="color:#ffd966;">Golden Gun Super Energy, </span>ranging between<span style="color:#ffd966;"> 1.5%</span> to <span style="color:#ffd966;">4.5%</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Actual amount varies by </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Enemy Rank</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td><td class="s36">Armamentarium</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZhVBQtptc5EEBz3-Sk_Uw0AG2GbpcDXvCnAdBYU2rnUdbMrMBaiUfCCK1IfzAs57Mcel330uiI5XbcKxCIGpytI9MsQtnNYn3Av0NkTaZzcOnb3a7-L1VWExQVcqJnnCYPEgJ0ulctnLW9Y--SAPHHN2grk-HL4DNM=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s37" rowspan="3">Passively grants a copy of <span style="color:#e0a261;">Firepower</span> and an extra <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Charge</span>.<br><br>Weapon Kills grant <span style="color:#e0a261;">10% Grenade Ability Energy</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Usage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills Magazine / <span style="color:#e0a261;">Dissipates 100% Heat</span>.</td><td class="s46">Chromatic Fire</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbVfRDuXjkvp2PmLTj9JlFC2ZhhcRCsccId5bfQdoEr3qhLHLK1T4kfTvKdF7ZG2BRSWabcG-v6hDE-ffjOYgQGYaedL70MuDXpq1l7jYXhO_uFL41d_Pd65VCZw21u7YWg7tpwC8uaV_kpUYPbk0jgILZunt6JwA=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s53" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Kinetic Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-style:italic;">: <br></span>Enemy explodes in a <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super-Matching</span> <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Explosion</span> that inflicts an <span style="color:#c27ba0;">Elemental-Matching Debuff</span>.<br>Grants a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Crystalline Transistor</span> for 11 seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#ffd966;">2 stacks</span>.<br>Loses<span style="color:#ffd966;"> 1 Crystalline Transistor stack</span> upon expiring, rather than all of them.<br><br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental Explosion</span>:<br>Deals up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">252 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[100]</span><span style="color:#999999;"> </span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental Damage </span>and inflicts an <span style="color:#c27ba0;">Elemental Debuff</span> based on the equipped <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super</span>.<br>Radius is based on the amount of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Crystalline Transistor stacks</span>.<br>Base = 4 meters | <span style="color:#ffe599;">x1 </span>= 6 meters | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x2</span> OR <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic </span><span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill</span> = 8 meters. <br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc:</span><span style="color:#a2c4c9;"> </span><span style="color:#999999;">Blind</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> for </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">?</span><span style="color:#a2c4c9;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[1]</span><span style="color:#a2c4c9;"> </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">seconds.<br></span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Solar: x15</span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#f6b26b;">+5</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Scorch.<br></span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void:</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="color:#c27ba0;">Weaken</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">for 4 seconds.<br></span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis: x30 Slow for 7</span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#6fa8dc;">+1</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> seconds.<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Strand:</span><span style="color:#93c47d;"> </span><span style="color:#6aa84f;">Sever </span><span style="color:#63d275;">for 6</span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#63d275;">+2</span><span style="color:#63d275;"> seconds.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R22" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">23</div></th><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXyILwFijPjsUq4YNazrokR9pFs7WuxmrTE75a1Ejp77ct3qERfJ6s4aLe5e_E7Fn1VO59_7hMtEtMRYd-HZcFhoBdg_6NLD8WTWP94P7q7fhLOy8Kui8GX03twcTT8kTDxkwfM0NQiP8ZeaTUfGfVXGJKUSj0KtA3peQ=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td