eight:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s55" rowspan="3">75% Damage Resist against Explosive Self-Damage.<br><br>Kills charge up <span style="color:#ffd966;">Blastwave Striders</span>:<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-and-File</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">10%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite+ </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">25%</span> | <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">20%</span><br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Alethonym&#39;s </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Vestiges </span>=<span style="color:#ffd966;"> 10% <br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon either </span><span style="font-style:italic;">dealing </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Shiver Strike or Howl of the Storm Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or receiving </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f9cb9c;">Explosive Self-Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while at </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">100% Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Propels the wearer 25 meters backwards, granting <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">x5 Frost Armor</span>.<br>Releases an expanding <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Wave</span> that inflicts <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Freeze </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[x? Slow for ? seconds] </span>over 15 meters<span style="color:#ea9999;">.<br></span>Shoots out <span style="color:#ffd966;">8 Tracking Shrapnel</span>, each dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">623 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Damage</span> over 8 meters on impact.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f9cb9c;">Self Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> = Arcing Trajectory | </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Shiver/Howl Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> = Straight ahead.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Shrapnel kills do not charge up Blastwave Striders.<br><br></span>Explosive Head, Explosive Payload, and Timed Payload can <span style="color:#ffd966;">trigger Blastwave Striders</span> despite not dealing <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">self-damage</span>.</td><td class="s28">Contraverse Hold</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb-T176zee2lng-KRsU8LgaLlAHjn0VfrdtlOz5MlI0H0bi77Nlqwjf-CzF8Yl2ohu23QqQaZ0g5MgyCj-TK6KUOAs1iSG0S1YheuhHxfP7YIyGwbrWzZjLhsmL2gSWCO8_OOpslndcfNSjKUSVZszkq95DrkweLZu2=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s56" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Overcharged Grenades</span> inflict <span style="color:#c27ba0;">Weaken </span>for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">6?</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[2.5?]</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">overcharging </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Void Grenade</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">with </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Chaos Accelerant</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants 20% Damage Resist.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon dealing </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Overcharged Void Grenade Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;"><br></span>Triggers <span style="color:#ffd966;">Chaotic Exchange </span>for 1.75 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Chaotic Exchange</span> grants <span style="color:#e0a261;">Additional Base Grenade Regeneration Rate.</span><br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Axion:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">5000% </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[4000%]</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Additional Base Grenade Regeneration Rate.</span><br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Scatter:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">3700%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[2700%]</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Additional Base Grenade Regeneration Rate.<br></span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Vortex:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">3400%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[2400%]</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Additional Base Grenade Regeneration Rate.</span><br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">HHSN:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">2500%?</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[2000%]</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Additional Base Grenade Regeneration Rate.</span><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Incurs a 4 second cooldown between activations which is removed on Grenade Usage.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R28" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">29</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWA_SfQ6yubXcX1zyrvNtgaL0EOGBlBQdBsLpTQ6HS_gH1rshuZSXjNQSkLR8OPoOzpfAJy_Ggoud11VkJ2z33namHVOtARgcOQ06ciSP1NgbnUG9TJwIVfRbhoyiAdP2Rv8ta9MdBgF8-HWJkdZCVzN_HZ2J8rMImVCrM=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s41"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWRd_8AlpqCn8MEs1Xo8XEVzleHAKR5P1OlIupC7rtCBvLPBeoJ-0CQVno