<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">x4 Ability Element-Matching Weapon Surge</span> and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">highlights </span>the enemy for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">16 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[11]</span> seconds.<span style="color:#d5a6bd;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is not refreshable.<br></span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"><br></span>Killing <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">highlighted enemies </span>spawns a <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Subclass-Matching Elemental Pickup.</span></td><td class="s38">Cadmus Ridge Lancecap</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVV3ImKUSerfCoTWWu2OUqnG89_4hR8l_pN0NkV7RuHjdw-_Cvj5tMeg6YuqN6RKf_OqCoiEeYmTuv7JpD3LmnzWRfBbYTQ0iCEW2XIbi_nCrjrbrdACoBDZO8Gy76peKYITQzMl7lnD8fQxEFzvQLYw5V4aO3uU2zhCw=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s55" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Diamond Lance</span> creates a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Crystal</span> on impact. <br>Scoring a hit against a <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">non-Rank-and-File Combatant</span> creates <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">3 Stasis Crystals</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Diamond Lance damage</span> is increased by <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Frost Armor stacks</span>.<br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">x1 = 144% </span>|<span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> x2 = 253% </span>|<span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> x3 = 333% </span>|<span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> x4 = 389% </span>|<span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> x5 = 428% </span>|<span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> x6 = 455% </span>|<span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> x7 = 475% Increased Damage.<br>Diamond Lance Slam first grants Frost Armor before dealing damage, always getting damage buffed.<br></span><br><span style="font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> is equipped:<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;"> 3 Precision Hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">of each while behind a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Rally Barricade</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> OR<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">100% Counter</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> by scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Weapon Hits</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">each<br></span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis </span><span style="color:#999999;">Bodyshot </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">5%</span> | <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis</span> <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Hit</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">12% </span><span style="font-style:italic;">OR </span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">2 Stasis Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br><br></span>Spawns a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Diamond Lance</span> beside you.<span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">?</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">[8]</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"> second cooldown that is shared with the Diamond Lance Aspect.</span></td><td class="s26">Crown of Tempests</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUBe5HbDKAyQl8zKz5SWMH6DGzTpqfdGlkKpDleMCVBAneBSjulFGGfFcc5D0Wudfq9LUm_tmPxypRKQxqshzjIOeWzzHCPVjLWJty8SnY3RzNplf5ePMUQZVHaGITe9G2KlATJQSyzZqsnX41LSEAILBYPfICH-FJVXA=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While at least </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">1 Arc Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">equipped</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;">Upon scoring an </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Ability Kill</span><span style="color:#76a5af;"> </span>or a <span style="color:#76a5af;">Jolt Kill</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span> Grants a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Conduction Tines</span> for <span style="color:#9fc5e8;">10</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[4]</span><span style="color:#e06666;"> </span>seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#ffd966;">3 stacks</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> All </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">stacks </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">disappear simultaneously. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Very short cooldown between gaining stacks</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Conduction Tines</span><span style="color:#a2c4c9;">:<br></span>168% | 335% | 503% Additional Base<span style="color:#f3f3f3;"> </span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Grenade</span>, <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span>, and<span style="color:#f3f3f3;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super </span>Regeneration Rate.<span style="color:#ffe599;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">22% | 44% | 65% Decreased Stormtrance Passive Super Drain.<br></span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Ionic Sentry Placement</span> triggers a <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Storm Grenade</span> on its position.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R31" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">32</div></th><td class="s49"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWjhzWswb6xfG8MWFF9X2Q9L06KyOmYZXe6B6RRiK-l8GzGJStNc3XPjAOoKRBXm6eKccsGNpa5e7pte8_v026-W9aOuE1mIB1EoS3HLUjQXrYnNUrAb5HDXs0WydIwL3uKy0xS1KwnnfWOpitSKzpz5D-2XgbcW7EryuY=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s41"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWowdmZJFZXnfhOtL85ZGMoPzyzLsY44TS4idXxXfSaNTdCELaG7JAmGD8aSDFM089LqySqFbWzE3biKj-xdEWbAJMbEJ0toJEBcUM692uHsNyUKBpgAjnTjANBNGK3cG3RxX68hhD5ruyuKG9EgsAS6HYR9WE7QXkc6A=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbF8x8UqX_CNHenlQ3elBmHpH3T0xOh_UOrvgWQRhsZ8RTMwD0cjLNqE7JRd4t1aA0BisUhUMjrq3X84ZEADB_c_NdSTjw-EC-JRiL_Pf3i_KfkSNexlvANEqtwLukyKK4h_YzFoBSchC4KCndp8x8FRcOO9XlOzbRH=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div><