;">Overshield </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+25 Stability, +25? Handling, and -5% Accuracy Cone Size.<br>Weapons receive <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">15% increased damage against Combatants</span>.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat Weapons</span> are instead granted <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">20% increased damage against Combatants</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Damage buff stacks with everything.</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><br></span><br>Scoring a kill while an <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Overshield </span>is active prepares <span style="color:#e6b8af;">Hasty Escape</span>.<br><span style="color:#e6b8af;">Hasty Escape</span> grants +30? Mobility for 5 seconds when <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Overshield </span>is depleted.</td><td class="s36">Citan&#39;s Ramparts</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYL_CTClY3gH4iOg4VMDLJZKTgcWeDuL6M4uCbo3PTZ_MWVA3_rKxURnmbx6WReE3Jgd4yySJbx7RbCD1hlQz1qjCczX4wIPHljHnwQak4f-vgIlUq26o3ubX2U62HTygS97AHDbXjT0X_Jnvqjnvvq6VGk4LQ-qN7l=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s37" rowspan="3">Modifies <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Towering Barricade</span><span style="color:#9fc5e8;"> </span>into <span style="color:#ffd966;">Assault Barricade.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Assault Barricade</span> enables the user and their <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>to shoot through it.<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;"><br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians deal 60% increased damage towards Assault Barricade (312.5 eHP)</span></td><td class="s24">Dawn Chorus</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xU5exFqpPX0zaNkxUYvJ2CdzIvXnjZeJ6sYQJZWNfzb6mUcLW5Om2sWddju8kt3zYwmhWKpASy09dWF8-BoePWN3DLHi3n7w2H0wocmeEKZQYIdvPR53u8VKwyJC8uYoQfqIzEN4k3xg25GmZy3VfmtDlwitvscfi38hQ=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#ffd966;">Daybreak Projectiles </span>trigger an <span style="color:#ff9900;">Ignition</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> </span>on hit.<br><br><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Scorch ticks </span>grant <span style="color:#89cdd1;">5?% Melee Ability Energy</span><span style="color:#79bec3;"> </span>per tick. <br><br><span style="color:#ff9900;">Ignitions </span>deal 100% increased damage. <br>Each enemy damaged by an <span style="color:#ff9900;">ignition </span>grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">40% Melee Ability Energy</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Solar Fulmination (Hunter&#39;s Journal)</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">doubles </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">the </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Melee Ability Gained</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> and has its damage doubled.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R34" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">35</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXJaLFmVGK_GMEghexIX6VGE4_RVbeL1X2Rcn6F4KdSDV4VjGwLoHJhX8APzJuxNViHkJxn2rI9BYIrcJvipFGX2zN3o_OCK-cXwdkUbRFrgTQM3Dh8lIafzOVc_2Uh56JmQAgEMLh0qKvgWZFkRm9mpjs51JyETFR-VLg=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVxyakcELkPvGVgupXPGlE1xJ1yHROSDEKsrPcUIj0aVZneQRTUBQ9w1VBj9O5u2kXiHcEqPpuJCly6n8FamPnXxDMGBnaL9THuYT5coyokmRkPEAFcWEXX0CbkBWBtSv1oRdsMtiZTYUJyFxZpfzZWpf8yg2aN4v53Eg=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYgJBTgyt0ccBCyYQ3svzDO7Zxb62V4ZqeVVTKT1wHsOtFKuTmGVWH3oLUwyKwMGHj5QDLfUyC--A_cRJfSWS3nt7FUbHEcbRsv5gHp90DMoHQPVsrGyvy4fc2BcQhWuzAJ0_M1YH-XsWDldAi8EyYBupKGREoS6w=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R35" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">36</div></th><td class="s21">Kismet</td><td class="s42">Assault Barricade</td><td class="s33">Rites of Ember</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R36" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">37</div></th><td class="s10">Fr0st-EE5</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa6LDoR_rTYdDr9GfAvioBaiJA2b6U0vW5CGxeubV0QFK5BQBvcmV-A8tIbp3f1fBZZbbIgVfAzA_VAy1WKYBx4i8-7M8r5RsnjB7s4fY1lZnWwE6g2bimtsf91WdyphP8CUtypUop7tdYts4Ib9LFDzYbN89vLgy73=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s12" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While Sprinting:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#9fc5e8;"> <br></span><span style="font-size:8pt;color:#a4c2f4;">2x Grenade and Melee Regeneration Speed </span><span style="font-size:8pt;">|</span><span style="font-size:8pt;color:#ea9999;"> 100% Additional Base Grenade/Melee Regeneration Rate<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">100%</span><span style="color:#e06666;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[200%]</span><span style="color:#df4545;"> </span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Additional Base Class Ability Regeneration Rate.<br></span>Grants a stack of <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Frost Armor</span> every <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">3</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[6]</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">Cannot stack beyond x1 Frost Armor without Whisper of Rime in PvP.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br>While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Frost Armor</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">x3</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[x1]</span> <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Weapon Surge</span>.</td><td class="s36">Crest of Alpha Lupi</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYqTdE4KoHdG3NjYawblzWgYXgbSgUQNAdcys8B91aRsyRlfBieiRGBLwky7l7rTcr9ZG0SPKOI9ldOq9LpubQGhkjbPL1VTiz6_culaGngZu_JokKVi7uAzxK8cW6-xNziLaLJ7Y1i59MOTJwHanK2ONna6P0AW6V5=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s51" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Instantly <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores Health </span>and <span style="color:#7cadff;">Shields</span> to the <span style="color:#ffd966;">wielder</span> and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies in Line of Sight </span>within 12 metres, centered on the <span style="color:#ffd966;">wielder</span>.<br><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Healing </span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">is based on the equipped Class Ability.<br>Barricade </span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores 160 Health</span> and <span style="color:#7cadff;">110 Shields</span>. <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Thruster </span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores 60 Health</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"><br></span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Healing </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Allies </span>grants <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">?% Barricade Energy</span> up to <span style="color:#e06666;">once every 1? second</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"><br></span>Scoring direct hits within 3 seconds of each while behind a <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Barricade </span>progresses a <span style="color:#ffd966;">Counter System</span> that triggers an additional <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">healing pulse</span> that <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores 30 HP</span> over 12 meters upon reaching 100%.<br>SMG, Trace = <span style="color:#ffd966;">7.14%</span> || Auto, MG = <span style="color:#ffd966;">8.33%</span> || Pulse = <span style="color:#ffd966;">9.1%</span> || Sidearm = <span style="color:#ffd966;">12.5%</span> || HC, Scout = <span style="color:#ffd966;">16.7%</span><br>Sword = <span style="color:#ffd966;">20%</span> | Bow, Glaive, GL, Shotgun, Snipers = <span style="color:#ffd966;">34%</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 2 second cooldown upon triggering before additional hits count.<br></span><span style="color:#e06666;"><br>Incurs a 5 second cooldown upon triggering a healing pulse before other pulses will restore health again.<br></span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e06666;">Yes, it is desynced from the hit counter cooldown. Why? Dunno<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Abilities</span><span style="color:#fdd24d;"> </span>generate an extra <span style="color:#ffd966;">Orb of Power that grants 7.14% Super Energy</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Ward of Dawn</span> generates a total of <span style="color:#ffd966;">4 Orbs</span>, each granting <span style="color:#ffd966;">3.57% Super Energy</span>, for a total of <span style="color:#ffd966;">14.3% Super Energy.</span></td><td class="s13">Deimosuffusion</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xW_vISDXrwwlRIQ4IAe4amfsjgBSFQtPsBoxbs3pej2W8AkbDWQV32ghJ3ruUpp74FeV2LOysmMMXM_h1Nadoa2CKPmSorO7A-uxPZP0hjo7OwOuDz-AJQqQQgFNj4KqvpUr8a9Q0gq9wEbqvbXFv1EgZ_fBFJ3DswuZDU=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s57" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">Strand </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is equipped:<br></span><br>Casting a <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Rift </span><span style="color:#6aa84f;">suspends </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">combatants </span>within 6 meters.<br><br><span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspension </span>inflicted by the user is <span style="color:#ffd966;">enhanced</span>.<br>Killing <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspended Enemies</span> <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores 15 Health</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Malevolent Grasp</span>:<br><span style="color:#63d275;">Suspended Enemies </span>are dealt <span style="color:#999999;">increasingly higher Kinetic Damage</span> every <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">0.467</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[0.3]</span> seconds.<br><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restores 5 HP</span> every time a <span style="color:#63d275;">Suspended Enemy</span> takes damage from <span style="color:#999999;">Enhanced Suspension DoT</span>.<br><span style="color:#999999;">Damage </span>begins at <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">23</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[9]</span>, increasing by <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">~5.5%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?%]</span> per tick on average.<span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Longer Suspend = Bigger Damage</span><br><span style="color:#63d275;">Suspended Enemies </span>are dealt <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">64 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[34?]</span> <span style="color:#b7b7b7;">Damage </span>once <span style="color:#63d275;">Suspension </span>expires.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Deals a total of ~380 </span><span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> on an Elite Combatant. </span><span style="color:#63d275;">Thread of Continuity</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> increases it to ~550.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Malevolent Grasp</span> inflicted through <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Rift Cast</span> deals 112.5% increased damage. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Numbers above do NOT include this.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R37" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">38</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXyUjmRzWrVpbmox6Du96Il-zo6i2cnY73LcqU8VNwNGkWJKvQe9pQ1qf2w-ryjamYWRFyN0V_RnVYsjROxX-DcYcgZnvlwGzEippAkjh0pPo_MAAG-RF5JEHECU36DLWttG2eZnLjGlxKBxyaWai93y4c7W0E80jzbuBw=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUQ1fhhCaOXRGz6aY5-6DdN14mY2wzwRugg2Xso2MKgAI-cbljoDH_xgMAO7zffIgn5LgtEi-3RO4RYHhsKcZu_Pn983CPrFeQuZv-S2FhFLRYKVOuQTI0YgykpkvzWcAY5tOS45j9MNP5-oB2aYLIB82bEPwOfG4Shcw=s110-w110-h69