 </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td><td class="s24">Eunoia</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXtQSFwEHbVXMlvwHmLgfen8z9Qi-6k6N7AofoY5WNgEqPO-D7FpFA3pCkXkazWamdkSLAi6ZdXhsJmYE4UOutlBmRc8fVC6K-CWDEPEEjayla06Nr47q8CBGSwoJUir_UxYOblkgosP_hkvbbBgWYl1QNSFxtQ3JMg-a4=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#e0a261;">Hellion Projectiles</span> deal 20% increased damage after travelling 17 meters.<br><br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Hellion Projectiles</span> that have been in the air for 1 second release <span style="color:#ffd966;">4 pieces of Shrapnel</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Shrapnel </span>deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">18</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar Damage </span>and inflicts <span style="color:#f6b26b;">x5</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+0</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Scorch</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Shrapnel projectiles</span> have tracking.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R40" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">41</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUDmbjl5FCbcz3BGUCu5gLQ7jf6UXxPRjj7wmhGWPjS5u-jKgaQNlSkHiTBYSBZBYTpyHdCZYIGMWBmm7qyGngoMs21a2cAG-2kzkpkUD7C5H7-fW1qWG3_MOjfTYVmgUJaPUW3vTBS62viHnyxlaBMoXHQvGNHfL7ydnA=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYcQr2AnQDKK4tGDl6-GH5Eu