n style="color:#ffd966;">3 stacks</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Vanishing Shadow duration</span> does not decrease while <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Invisible</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#d9d2e9;">x1</span> = 166.6% Additional Base <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade</span> and <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span>, and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">67% Class Ability</span> Regeneration Rate.<br><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">x2</span> = 333.3% Additional Base <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade</span> and <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span>, and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">134% Class Ability</span> Regeneration Rate.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">x3 </span>= 500% Additional Base <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade</span> and <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span>, and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">200% Class Ability</span> Regeneration Rate.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">x3 Vanishing Shadow</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> or gaining </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Void Invisibility </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while at </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">x3 Vanishing Shadow</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+<span style="color:#d5a6bd;">15 Void Overshield HP</span> for 7<span style="font-size:7pt;color:#b4a7d6;">+3? </span>seconds.</td><td class="s28">Doom Fang Pauldron</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZeJ7QRR1ezZOLtakLSl7tOCrFMK1gDbWDY-ZCC9LQb-4kX4c5QZqK6sdQRhd6l_gLAtbov6KBcBkq6xFdHLmMNGNQdpQ9W_hsKQqzgXKOlU7jNM85sfGR3i6P1u9C8aJTZAHYyTN6uM4lZXdEykrpzHCf8qQ5FPwNq=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s48" rowspan="3">Scoring<span style="color:#8e7cc3;"> </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">2–3 Void Kills</span> within 10 seconds of each grants a <span style="color:#bba5f3;">stack </span>of<span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void Weapon Surge</span> for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">11 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[6]</span> seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#bba5f3;">x4 Void Weapon Surge</span>.<br>Additional<span style="color:#bba5f3;"> Void Kills</span> while at <span style="color:#bba5f3;">x4 Weapon Surge</span> refresh the buff duration.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Powered Void Melee Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">20%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [10%]</span><span style="color:#fdd24d;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Energy. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Can only trigger once per </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Melee Activation</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#bba5f3;">x4 Void Weapon Surge</span> for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">11 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[6]</span> seconds.<br><span style="color:#dfbc45;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Sentinel Shield&#39;s</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Shield Throw Hits</span> grant<span style="color:#dfbc45;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">10% Super Energy, </span>extending <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Duration.<br>Sentinel Shield Light Attack Kills</span> grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">100% Shield Throw Energy</span>.</td><td class="s16">Eye of Another World</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZWg_1uAfZeA155msNJj4k0TipCOQveWwcP-i_9YPVE-CpCtMK9d9EaNr2Ar4fewX7SooAFa4gwhz7-qvYvtI1IlArRUIrLYIlOv9RzICaPY1PMP0yOZ58BzMsJ6RJ9mdjbSZqCXlrBqHHGMB9OuWzu6NeN2FD0kv5x=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s17" rowspan="3">Passively grants 45% Additional Base <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade</span>, <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span>, and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span>Regeneration Rate, and +15 Airborne Effectiveness.<br><br>Highlights enemies below<span style="color:#dd7e6b;"> 50% HP</span> enemies in a <span style="color:#e06666;">red outline</span>.<br>Highlights <span style="color:#ea9999;">Enemy Guardians</span><span style="color:#f3f3f3;"> </span>with <span style="color:#fdd24d;">Fully-charged Supers </span>in a<span style="color:#f3f3f3;"> </span><span style="color:#ffe599;">yellow outline</span><span style="color:#d9d9d9;">.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Invisible enemies that are below 50% HP or have a fully-charged Super will also be highlighted.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R43" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">44</div></th><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZy5PoqLDtV6lSywU97Zl17iPV6U0yZ8uzx50RTQQtZbjjVMcMlvf8DMRck_1K5Vdf_gh8zNYFzGqFN65mqRv52Ti1acKOSZ-sPVQPy6ui_f3SmsGKrJ-XmOlTLfizT9kU2ECs9oZphHzg0xj3UYNNFPTyoDuxqlbO0=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYKRLia3IHACsVYHlnZBbkNDH55icxLE9eD4PV-kPhubF3Q524GaTG2rGaeF5a6Qypj150WkupQLt9oMRqi7Ajze3L2rOXjfLE7hbDaadV4NO4hImv0fIoFqmniQkIfyO7X8TgnvXIVK4V8lWwQS0Tcnuxpba60SLuN=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbg-SIfN6mDyq94aoLHv6nURz8DG9bkXwu_-LBUj0aVam9L87VGxoPGPuEMqr2H4YNS2YOSppgpurhd2L0BAxh5qssnQgZr7e5s-jVCJ42FTC4iUDXX5rSn8XkcnRCfh5rJuUJxPewVhfK0lJRmbLRllhI7pow-uZZR=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R44" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">45</div></th><td class="s35">Vanishing Shadow</td><td class="s35">Horns of Doom</td><td class="s23">Cerebral Uplink</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R45" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">46</div></th><td class="s26">Gifted Conviction</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXLX7c9ArGxDTfLvJKUxbTAvD2XN_AV20ZkyQOLegoPFFAD5aTbdPqljUK4ZS1Yv69QUSg_PWBlOH2qRxli0h8ehr4Q_FHtV3WbltWqCNTalPSvy7ygq527WBrvLCIc_N1dGrOO7_IeuRmDxRu7W-mng32fUO1CNSF0Gks=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon using </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Ascension </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Tempest Strike</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Releases 3 tracking <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc projectiles</span> forward.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Projectiles</span> deal up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">200</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[40]</span> damage and inflict <span style="color:#76a5af;">jolt</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Arc Projectiles count towards Sword on-hit effects while a Sword is readied.</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"><br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">inflicting </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#76a5af;">Jolt</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#76a5af;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">to </span><span style="font-style:italic;">enemies </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">15? meters</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants a stack of Resist for 10 seconds, up to a maximum of 4 stacks.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Additional </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#76a5af;">Jolt Applications</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> to enemies within 15? meters refreshes the buff duration.<br><br></span>Damage Resist Scaling:<br><span style="color:#76a5af;">1 Jolt Applications</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">25%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [5%] </span>Damage Resist <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Resist x2)<br></span><span style="color:#76a5af;">2 Jolt Applications</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">40%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[7.5%] </span>Damage Resist <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Resist x3)</span><br><span style="color:#76a5af;">3 Jolt Applications</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">50%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[10%]</span> Damage Resist <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Resist x4)</span></td><td class="s36">Dunemarchers</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZjkfa-GW_xHcFXCkKPW8L9TKCV0i-dRDRV63vqSOVway21MFDmFv7T8aOmKpFcXzcCQjUTQEKD1ThQlxemzySMCDAvtW8lR25wpNKYq7zqQVI6xRdTC43KqoGrn2Eu9Rcuhp8og8FhfvQGoCfLIJqK9TwPkNsyT5vn=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s37" rowspan="3">Increases Sprint Speed from 8m/s to 8.5m/s.<br>Increases Slide Distance from 6.5 meters to 8.5 meters.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;">sprinting </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">for </span><span style="font-style:italic;">1.5 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Linear Actuators</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> </span>for 7 seconds.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Direct Melee Hit</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Linear Actuations</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Consumes <span style="color:#ffd966;">Linear Actuations</span> to inflict <span style="color:#76a5af;">Shocked </span>for 2 seconds.<br><span style="color:#76a5af;">Shocked Enemies</span> release a <span style="color:#76a5af;">Static Charge</span> to <span style="color:#76a5af;">non-Shocked Enemies</span> within 12 meters.<br><span style="color:#76a5af;">Static Charge</span> deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">220</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [50]</span> damage and inflicts <span style="color:#76a5af;">Shocked</span>.<br><span style="color:#76a5af;">Shocked </span>refreshes when spreading to other enemies <span style="color:#e06666;">up to 6 times</span> per <span style="color:#ffd966;">Linear Actuations trigger</span>.<br>Grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">x2 Bolt Charge</span> per <span style="color:#76a5af;">Shocked </span>inflicted.<span style="color:#ea9999;"><br>Guardians are immune to additional chain damage for 2 seconds while Shocked.</span></td><td class="s26">Fallen Sunstar</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xU5XsW1xU-eVJjr0vSyzfSuIXhAU9aTLpvy0auPhqmcjoA8bSRD5puXWbFZBq1PX7jhz9zSFrSIh3-Fx845ehy4Mk3DwxRXDxJD21zejYHrft3qoJLj9Lb_ZU8nDTj9823b6k5Nr20kBbRV189cVrYHW0EXTZs8M-krYN0=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Ionic Traces</span> move 66% faster and grant increased Ability Energy.<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a2c4c9;">Total Ability Energy Gained per Ionic Trace:<br></span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Grenade: 25%</span> | <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee: 25% </span>| <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability: 30%<br></span><br><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d0e0e3;">Ionic Trace</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> Pickup:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Allies </span>within 15 metres receive 10% <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Grenade</span>, <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span>, and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span>Ability Energy.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R46" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">47</div></th><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWg9nH2WvqDzr84dZbbgQi53BK45NboIpasM0dC7sgyj298nJlJbZi6a5irqfHeu6jPYsvPCtisDccPX_2TYcz-0J9Sb8CvRidax1ZfsCb3hvJcoWsuN6-PUb-dUwmh8fIOPx2apHSk-K52m_qIGRdOxugHuky8_Vt7RQ=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaMPzGwaYM2CHmEy3WktZ4bSHN4N5McNArPs5Bqp87_7hYRT6Ax9kjYqK7a7C6wGjs28R3CHwpQOW8cwOLp8rSOtIEjZyFu4MLnmSr5Qw8-z1tvAMGd4YMcx2t-TeTYhFTBA_W_OTRRyFf0HBGlPcuFH0lJEF1Hamwk=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbxxaDKE8bPezRbxDKB9juW18QXsfcs5bJqSCi2Wj0IZlGR0eNP9AImLmD_5Pd5GqXKhQm6PckLAySPBRCLEh5l-R5EqAqHQTdkq1fLTqeUjRT95N7xFWfwwuZ0jOaxTBMMehGtkBynLtYtjGO1ZJFs85pq_EUX2Zpd=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R47" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">48</div></th><td class="s34">The Gift of Certainty</td><td class="s42">Linear Actuators</td><td class="s34">Ionic Conductor</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R48" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">49</div></th><td class="s28">Gwisin Vest</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLazo2g6-vUp-_XznmJUtawcSvUM9dhaYpZVj_EjU4qXwh5EveMS213vq9ZwoqcxSxjX_o927SEryDptaV-bb4oJ7-kX16_RAYUb4N9BFj7nmXKee5pF4o3CL3WNQc4cCGsVLTPLJhsp7bCqUKsXrc9jGoTQi3FfkYhh=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s48" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Void Invisibility</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> ending, while within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">15 meters</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of an enemy:<br></span>Triggers a <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Snare Bomb</span> on the user.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 5 second cooldown between activations.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Does not interact with </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Trapper&#39;s Ambush</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While in</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"> Spectral Blades:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#cfbff5;"><br></span>Restores <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Energy</span><span style="color:#fdd24d;"> </span>on Heavy Attack based on the amount of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Spectral Blade </span>Kills and Hits.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Energy % Extension gains based on hits and kills<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">?%<br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">?%</span></td><td class="s26">Eternal Warrior</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaT5XGtetmgHpx5wCZhCnISBnJuRixWjh34OU5ru1r3HAm-JhJ-yBMbRsgfsrDgZBQw1MkEWSTfarfH0t1kdC9zX1Vp_g0m0n96-32uEzuW13keXcUo9irQ5QuNJDD9aqIzbo-sgA25j8zuMrTSU2wgVeea4KZz0wco=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3">Scoring <span style="color:#89cdd1;">2–3 Arc Kills</span> within 10 seconds of each grants a <span style="color:#89cdd1;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Weapon Surge</span> for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">11 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[6]</span> seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#89cdd1;">x4 Arc Weapon Surge</span>.<br>Additional <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Kills</span> while at <span style="color:#89cdd1;">x4 Weapon Surge</span> refresh the buff duration.<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Fists of Havoc</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Cast</span><span style="font-style:italic;">: <br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#7cadff;">75 HP Overshield</span> that negates <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Damage</span>.<br>Regenerates over 7 second after 5 seconds of not receiving damage if <span style="color:#7cadff;">Overshield </span>is active.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Fists of Havoc Kills</span> grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">?% Super Ability Energy</span>.<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Fists of Havoc End</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">x4 Arc Weapon Surge</span> for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">30 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[6]</span> seconds.</td><td class="s28">Felwinter&#39;s Helm</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZKVitudIKE_dTtH77mfN6oVPVEeq7TlawViVLKCDMW5vzceSPBWKD-sVzrW76Xe2pNYhg7bJmpdc81llBAQSmZpP1E7DUzGyhFMPaeMWeSbThaoheoJBFCooq9z3me9cxjcPjVx2VFv1NdFQJuocQyK6mo-BIvejDE=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s56" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Powered Melee Damage</span> inflicts <span style="color:#c27ba0;">regular weaken </span>for 6 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does not work with Grapple Melee nor Song of Flame</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br>On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Powered Melee Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Finisher</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Enemy triggers a <span style="color:#a64d79;">Highly Weakening Burst</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span>centered on the <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Enemy Death Location</span>, <span style="color:#999999;">disorienting </span>and <span style="color:#a64d79;">increasing damage by 30% for a variable duration.</span><span style="color:#c27ba0;"><br></span><span style="color:#a64d79;">Weakening Burst</span> Duration and Range are dependent on <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Enemy Rank (Finisher).</span><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">Screen becomes blackened for 7.5 seconds, progressively getting clearer as the debuff reaches its 15 second duration. HUD does not disappear.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Warlord&#39;s End.<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-and-File</span>: <span style="color:#a64d79;">Debuffs </span>in a 15 (20) meter radius for 10 (15) seconds.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite</span>: <span style="color:#a64d79;">Debuffs </span>in a 20 (25) meter radius for 15 (20) seconds.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Miniboss+</span>: <span style="color:#a64d79;">Debuffs </span>in a 25 (25) meter radius for 20 (20) seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R49" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">50</div></th><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYTTB1HBeV5gmekmFB2S8aOK_JoZ2vYkGujNEImxp6nfLPjU450zk_xyQ8hL6sARnlh21rCJhRZL0IjMnO_6AwwAv1yJc4QJcR4TFKs9ke7DniCaP6nu5r9j2tzfAfcGSNZcscAgfUZFWieij_d1MfuUvFol278fKoW=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbVjSv40vvSanFA7HIx5p-Yfr_y9OWtzbsmBPxY8vkGfQRdNcwV58PVre4qdrigLwiLAosSIPvKTaX5h5AgXAb_PsWXiVilbdsVxpmfqquIoROzYH7vxK18ACKR47u8XxVnL2xVMM5bhH-Biux7uC9xRB78onwuHN-3=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZQFYae4ytlahRCLiuZXlGZXrsdwEyHEewiVZj03EEbSxDybEhe7MqiTSW0GWh-T3WCx6mN3xaVdxhF5WctaBjFkX0dHkdJkpszLhKqcLN56Bz54wwZ5VpfxRKjk_A2SB1DoSFLos2sOVbbMnxlwDOeZEM_rgM83w=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R50" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">51</div></th><td class="s35">Roving Assassin</td><td class="s34">Resolute</td><td class="s35">Warlord&#39;s End</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R51" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">52</div></th><td class="s28">Gyrfalcon&#39;s Hauberk</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZBsrEt4TFx94sQc7JMUJMf08ptWvO3tIhtCEcKrPC57pnKBNNgwWoyfutOT3TWK9rgGx_tTKmUDEnufECNvRmB7-zQmJAeggPsZ_A4S6aN2PepGrA8rrlK3ScBk4mttlqDySvNHa5g6dVaDX3cG1mDCXvpZzh2Bg=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s48" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Void Invisibility</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">ending:<br></span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Volatile Rounds</span> for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">9 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[3]</span> seconds.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon performing a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Finisher </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while affected by </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Void Invisibility</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>35% increased damage for 6 seconds. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Doesn&#39;t stack with Empowering Buffs.</span><span style="color:#e06666;"><br></span>The <span style="color:#ffd966;">user </span>and their <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>within 24 metres receive a <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Reserve Overshield</span> <br><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Reserve Overshield:<br></span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">500% Additional Base Class Ability Regeneration Rate</span> until <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage.</span><br>Consumed on <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage</span>, granting a <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">40 HP Void Overshield</span> for 10 seconds.</td><td class="s24">Hallowfire Heart</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbvcDit9HaXD-WGEmSE-0BwdFYHLqgYPQMG3_LCkhHx-aXCBXYIF2Fb6MbX8hc1ZN9SF3pv9DFr-I8MmropMx92Qfj7tpdsCT4DeLuTWctjGwjFbwYaXsQlg0oWWtsuI9euAsycSb6hWo-BMVYO4BAX-66IpBIzTQ=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s52" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Solar </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">equipped </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">and </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">charged</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Ability Kills</span> grant<span style="color:#dd7e6b;"> x2 Cure</span> and grant stacks of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Sunfire Furnace</span>, up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">10 stacks</span> for 20 seconds.<br>Rank-and-File = 1 Stack | Elite = 2 | <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Unpowered Melee Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> also grant </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Cure </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">and </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">stacks</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Glaive Melees do not</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Sunfire Furnace</span>:<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span>and <span style="color:#e0a261;">Shieldburst Barricade</span> Kills trigger <span style="color:#ff9900;">ignitions</span>. <span style="font-style:italic;color:#fbbdec;">Grenade Element doesn&#39;t matter</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><br>Up to 250% Additional Base <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span>and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability</span> Regeneration Rate.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">6.5% | 13.6% | 22% | 32% | 43% | 57% | 73% | 93% | 118% | 150% Increased Super Damage.<br></span>?% | ?% | ?% | ?% | ?% | ?% | ?% | ?% | ?% | 250% Additional Base <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade</span>/<span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class</span> Regeneration Rate.<br><br>On <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Cast</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">Sunfire Furnace stacks</span> are frozen. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Cannot gain nor lose stacks.</span><span style="color:#e06666;"><br></span>On<span style="color:#ffd966;"> Super End</span> | Consumes all <span style="color:#ffd966;">Sunfire stacks</span> to refunds<span style="color:#ffd966;"> Super Energy based on the stack amount</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x1 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">8%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x2 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">20%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x3</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">26%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x4</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">33%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x5</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">45%</span>.</td><td class="s26">Geomag Stabilizers</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaR4vJPgsI1bvQm0uSIlcvS6xnVg86EdMIAlN1tjxsTFR4qy9H3rp0LI0epvfCj7u3bUfab6AubFLcZaNY-Eal-hFTFeaK_I08xBZSnD5WleQwpqKgdwZn3u44MNgSqpkQut_xdICmJceW9EEe5DbCfCkOoxiMt9zj6=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;">sprinting for 1.5 seconds and maintaining the sprint</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, while having </span><span style="font-style:italic;">at least </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">x5 Bolt Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants a stack of<span style="color:#89cdd1;"> Bolt Charge</span> every 0.33 seconds.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a2c4c9;">Ionic Trace</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> Pickup</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">+4% Chaos Reach Super Ability Energy</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Chaos Reach</span> grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">10% Super Ability Energy</span> on hit.<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Incurs a 0.75 seconds cooldown between activation.</span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;"> <br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"> Chaos Reach&#39;s Total Damage is increased by up to 120%</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R52" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">53</div></th><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa3PvIDuCxpOL2hfy9QDm6Prb7SH0Ck2EIHgOX2J3-OM1KVKNBTgjsnveHzKvpDzbwH6P9H0Ef1Y46Rc0AlAsf4ZgrA4exjqHLcCJlLrlit9ATm4DgrsXzH73Ao6nfCmyvc9ZJADRS1TfQQyMB3zhtMlLz38FrvJpWn=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s58"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbjDQS9Tv-IzgrI1YdtySybHwtcrPheoEaiNeHNAxBx4PceChxUGbdPlMVrf2TYkFoVzGLEjiIlut0FZhSXfBFua5W4x4ZQ_BcXSljgNmhoc07oVB-shKQ733YBB29OPjdKM4W8Bx_BgG0hKDSewKMtfyObfg2UFgG4=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb31O2JPkmOkUIoM7-y3TdDjgqqR3fQ6RnHW3iUfTQTRTbj50HQiLZFdzcIdubPLQfu95tczTD6Etp_R4_UExqw6R7oaB-KHvFD1QnFgHIIN4ro5aeg4biVGDuKyH6QjGGv2GqL0-SV5kPaRUtyhcMg53vk7RlCGA=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R53" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">54</div></th><td class="s35">See Me, Feel Me</td><td class="s33">Sunfire Furnace</td><td class="s34">Close Enough</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R54" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">55</div></th><td class="s28">Khepri&#39;s Sting</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ1PyWh9SkPxq8TX8YxEBzFO1xg2-O2k6Ulx8PuiW6Qk6Dvh4mIys_2nvDK5zM0TtPfzFbtODRSRN2uPpiKQ2QqUrRMQls2zi3KYRhERADJeE5Q8O3Q90E0qfQ7-Qg1-qqAZZz9G0xLG3554thTuGtl_a7_8b7eHvH5=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s48" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon killing a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#c27ba0;">Weakened Enemy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Void Melee Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">equipped</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Releases a <span style="color:#c27ba0;">weakening cloud of smoke</span> on <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Enemy Death Location</span>.<br>Grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">30% </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Ability Energy</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Functionally, the cloud of smoke is a Snare Bomb that is instantly detonated.</span></td><td class="s36">Hazardous Propulsion</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWQI2ytZCFjmPLORbY8qLAk49Hl2uyMDN-UjIAdtBNByMFG6q66WR07wPXtUG7dbUs1UnfeLSCi4URF65KEKc_l8PVtmEJs60vWRC80FuLHAwqLAlOsqNAsqCi--ELZOLlis-diY4XALQfeQTXEitLfOdma7NTMo8oXyaQ=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s51" rowspan="3">Scoring a <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill</span>, 4 Weapon Kills, or filling up a <span style="color:#ffd966;">counter </span>through <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Hits</span> grants a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Exodus Rocket</span>, up to a maximum <span style="color:#ffd966;">6 Exodus Rocket stacks</span>. <br><br><span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Hit Counter</span>:<br>Trace Rifles, and <span style="color:#ffd966;">Vex Mythoclast</span>: <span style="color:#f1c232;">10%</span><br>Auto Rifle and Machine Gun: <span style="color:#f1c232;">15%</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span>Pulse Rifles, Sidearms, and <span style="color:#ffd966;">Crimson</span>: <span style="color:#f1c232;">20%</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span>Hand Cannons, Scout Rifles, and Shotguns: <span style="color:#f1c232;">40%</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span>Bows, Linear Fusion Rifles, Rocket Sidearms, and Sniper Rifles: <span style="color:#f1c232;">67%</span><br><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#f1c232;">Precision Counter doesn&#39;t reset upon loading a rocket, leading to alternating shots in some cases.  (3 </span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;color:#f1c232;">-&gt; </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#f1c232;">2 </span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;color:#f1c232;">-&gt;</span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#f1c232;"> 3 HC shots, for example)<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Barricade Placement or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Thruster </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Usage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><br>Consumes all <span style="color:#ffd966;">stacks</span>, firing a <span style="color:#999999;">homing Kinetic Micro-Missile </span>per <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>, each dealing up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">540 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[28]</span> <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage</span> over ? meters and granting a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Exodus Rocket</span> for 10 seconds per hit scored.<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Exodus Rocket</span> grant increased Rocket and Micromissile Weapon Damage, up to 35% at <span style="color:#ffd966;">x6 stacks</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x1</span> = 10% | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x2</span> = 17% | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x3 </span>= 24% | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x4 </span>= 30% | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x5 </span>= 33% | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x6 </span>= 35%</td><td class="s26">Getaway Artist</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV0rSSu2ekcNfbMFLw7YvAm-IUjTlHseiFbeYXvw25iWE-A9z3tNIVQLRGWeuim8ivy90GqQWZRnUTTxBCwcZjjIBhpHeuWBfJS-XhCdQdFyLjx0PDNHvHDRrin5X1djPkVhc0nyag8Lk3W9NIzo6Qe67ceAz7dHRjDyyE=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Soul Hits</span> grant <span style="color:#e0a261;">5% Grenade Energy</span><span style="color:#f9cb9c;"> </span>up to once per burst.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does not grant </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Grenade Energy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"> on hit while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#8e7cc3;">Devour </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">is active.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Arc </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is equipped:<br></span>Holding<span style="color:#e0a261;"> [Grenade]</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> </span>summons an <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Soul</span> for 20 seconds and grants <span style="color:#79bec3;">Amplified</span>.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Soul Rifts</span> refresh <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Soul duration</span> to 20 seconds instead of 15 seconds while active.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R55" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">56</div></th><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUrTi8bA6JRrdJHarO3KimEB6jwUcvh_SCoBjE4NH05WmIKZ9yYimwzKBNeZjNWK8bdI5_G9EGQC8OSeyy1WtexhxJhVVK2IL1vW98n5bQNsKJiCF0PRMMWoNxbh1nAzl9ztjt4bgUvXlN69a7533DDl6fPO8K-Itf6DWo=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUYVfQxMNOOKzHOfoHxF6N4ZJwUKSqZsawyYwMMAzPUWxQ1ywY9R67wGrsh2bERUPfxQDUpICHTBACvmrpfVS13ySpiJCYRP4rr2hfwuw8ogDa65Z2PTWrkNo8BtsNBEgESrp2fJ136WpdT2fPgbq4XtnbeqqSJIPfvHxw=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYSbzeX0p3U8bLrOEbawF4_EF7sdVWH6w4xdIUqY-_cM_0GmSueczP2HLcvwadMNDLNDimMESIS5hI0us8Ntqd9TbFRTXc8yFUWAiQPP6WMvmbyQ6_CejLFZAq7wvXqayeBBc2sU7aMYg2QTEC_do5OCA1CCsMqhKKf=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R56" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">57</div></th><td class="s35">Touch of Venom</td><td class="s42">Danger Close</td><td class="s34">Dynamic Duo</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R57" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">58</div></th><td class="s10">Knucklehead Radar</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZzFCTlZyH8VATbuTjjCQ-cRQor5_yd7CJBfwJ7FDFvNi6PqJPEnQUhIthrSAS7uJfRaOLNdyeRlTqe_LxTzp6nBf32RZLxTOY7bSDCzE4ScgExROgXG9pgXqkvtsf83emlo4-75a1wbv99R7Ra7IPpdAxoBn2TegFZ=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s12" rowspan="3">Passively grants +20 Airborne Effectiveness and radar remains active while ADS.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> crouched</span>: <br>Grants Enhanced Radar.<br> <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Has 12 sectors instead of 6)<br><br>Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">dealing damage to a Combatant</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">breaking a Guardian&#39;s Shield</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Marks </span>enemies for 3 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Mark persists through walls.<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">If </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Enemy </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is below </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">30% Health</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">: </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span>1% increased Weapon and Ability Damage per percent below <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">30%</span>.<br><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">10% HP</span> left -&gt; 20% Increased Damage<span style="font-weight:normal;">. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#7cadff;">Shields </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">do not count as </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Health</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td><td class="s36">Heart of Inmost Light</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbhxMwEnChNuiLbTiZtW7gjLzv4uX79L_1h4LOcEM-gOQ0CGyrThADZDwaK6BqejCNFPZCeeuZk98kfXJlErM2s8zHNUnQ-vKz6q5p1wzIL2ksPHV_izAUsOWy8mxPBFa_6E-iU5ChBEjUf8btjSYhnSSCYcIQcew=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s37" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Ability Usage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">dealing </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Powered Melee Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Empowered Abilities</span> for the other two abilities for 5 seconds, up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">2 stacks</span>. <br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Ability Cast</span> <span style="color:#e06666;">removes all stacks.</span><br><span style="font-size:7pt;">e.g.: Dealing </span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#89cdd1;">Thunderclap damage</span><span style="font-size:7pt;"> -&gt; Increased </span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span><span style="font-size:7pt;">and </span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span><span style="font-size:7pt;">Ability Regeneration.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x1</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">400%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[100%]</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x2</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">800%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[200%]</span> Additional Base <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span>and <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee </span>Regeneration Rate. <br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x1 </span>=<span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> 25% </span>|<span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">x2</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span>=<span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> 50% Additional Base Class Ability Regeneration Rate.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">x1</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span>=<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> 20%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[10%]</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x2 </span>= <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">35%</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[20%] </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Increased Grenade Damage.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">x1 </span>=<span style="color:#89cdd1;"> 25% | </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">x2 </span>= <span style="color:#89cdd1;">50% Increased Melee Damage.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Buff display</span> is <span style="color:#e06666;">NOT</span> accurate to the active ability regen. <br><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">With the example in mind, </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> before </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Empowered x1</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> from </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Melee </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">runs out will do the following:<br></span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Empower</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"> </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">will go to </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">x2 </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">and will have its duration refreshed. </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Melee </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">will receive </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Empower x1</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> for 5 seconds, and </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Empower x1</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">won&#39;t be refreshed, despite the UI saying Empowered x2.</span></td><td class="s16">Karnstein Armlets</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbR0xdoPRPGeB-VsNFVnih-C197Id9IDlj3TwsnXXiqUP11kots-i1Sz_VgYYZIvzmOU1l5JarXKA8x6baGRwyJ7SefXZFyC8lsdo5CG1Di1-7WAJp-pRh3snatfRYmQMbfH8DBS-1Euv9n9-9PyvJAvMCusTVPP9Jy=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s17" rowspan="3"><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Melee Kill:<br></span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x3 Cure</span> and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration x1</span> for 8<span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+4</span> seconds.<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Finisher</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x3 Cure</span> and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration x2</span> for 8<span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+4</span> seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R58" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">59</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXovVBzKf_0ICe1ZkHjqCvXbhFc_BeZo_V5Xw0B9q9pcZhZaXixZEjSrfucnnkqByTUa4VWnzx0SKOkeiLREgxX9sSKbhNrLcKTet6MfFH8AWhoEcaVWA4UwRThKmri_0N3JRh1uJd3eJK5GZ0mDK064UXH8VK8Kskcyg=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYXQlbbs9j3J2x2TeojCc-qzWntU1NgpjaF04pl7cG9hzFMxuCzX5zzotowaYBdBA2PjRVcTKqskRaPCFh3GhS9qdLQHldwqB6DEL_W4MFJ7JDNYYrUVQxchGluCIMoSiNHGS763qkdIPpNO4AXRsvhoo-RwXNnEhvq=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYouU6lcnhdZ6DZHihVQOFs9eJOXPMBrmX1SCVDk6-U1i5kCu0LK4OOWLiRT2CirIbR5cs_NqI8ll7Etua8N0FyxYlB9Ssm02D0dfCq-ZSk07eN2JIJ533yzgoR0Q09avPrlKizBktDaQpHIyfirDhwGZeE4q9OX8O9=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R59" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">60</div></th><td class="s21">Upgraded Sensor Pack</td><td class="s42">Overflowing Light</td><td class="s23">Vampire&#39;s Caress</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R60" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">61</div></th><td class="s26">Liar&#39;s Handshake</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLblLh40kH0M1MpXF5sIXiPLIIL9ilHOOGX4fSou0gf5l3We3SQOKK5ma36kPg4ue9X9UzisA0rrtQFlqeRd4oK1pNL32QN7HzNb4HH_ea6I8a8sahFKaUi5redWNzku8XOlcLYbGDjTcbb5fKqmYmkwE8SJoxzPSlGs=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While an</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#76a5af;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Arc Melee</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">is equipped</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#76a5af;"><br></span>Receiving <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Damage</span>, or scoring a <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Powered Melee Hit </span>grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Cross Counter</span> for the next <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Hit</span> within 3 seconds.<span style="color:#79bec3;"><br></span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Cross Counter</span> grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">400% increased Melee Damage</span> and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores 40 HP</span> on <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Hit.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Cross Counter&#39;s</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee </span>deals <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Damage.</span></td><td class="s28">Helm of Saint-14</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZMui3YIzIrsWRVwrf9ik4i2NYwAuOuVStOnhBSCaWSE5WnpzVyQF1ibRQIymMCOFaDV5Cnj2nbZdFJzcmGenDQqABkOU4ynUYRt5I30Adyk14j9545d95YWKxpZG0Sj89pxnXkkEdWwTRZNuFLPytNhpvBkDbbXw=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s29" rowspan="3"><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Weapons of Light</span> from <span style="color:#ffd966;">Ward of Dawn</span> can now persist outside of the <span style="color:#ffd966;">bubble </span>for 15 seconds.<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">All of the following</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">only </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">applies while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Weapons of Light</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Dealing an <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">average of 600 of damage</span> and scoring kills grant <span style="color:#a481e1;">stacks </span>of <span style="color:#a481e1;">The Saint</span>, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#a481e1;">14 stacks</span>.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Damage = </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">1 stack</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> | Rank-and-File</span> = <span style="color:#a481e1;">1 stack</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite </span>= <span style="color:#a481e1;">2</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Miniboss+</span> = <span style="color:#a481e1;">3 </span>| <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians </span>= <span style="color:#a481e1;">3</span><br><span style="color:#a481e1;">The Saint&#39;s buff duration</span> is equal to the remaining duration of the <span style="color:#ffd966;">current Ward of Dawn</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Damage requirement IGNORES Power-Delta (Requires the same &quot;hits&quot; regardless of difficulty)<br></span>The minimum damage needed x hits for a<span style="color:#a481e1;"> &quot;The Saint&quot; Stack</span> is based on thresholds:<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">&gt;2,445 x 2 | &gt;767 x 3 | &gt;135 x 4 | &gt;109 x 5 | &gt;108 x 6 | &gt;89 x 7 | &gt;77 x 8 and so on, averaging 600 damage per stack<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;">fulfilling the same conditions</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> as gaining a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">stack </span><span style="font-style:italic;">of</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">The Saint</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">through scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Kinetic </span><span style="font-style:italic;">or</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Void </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Damage/Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Inflicts <span style="color:#8e7cc3;">Suppression </span>for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">6</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> seconds in a 7 meter radius around the target.<br><br>Picking up a <span style="color:#ffd966;">Ward of Dawn </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Core</span> <span style="color:#ceae33;">consumes </span>all <span style="color:#bba5f3;">stacks </span>of <span style="color:#a481e1;">The Saint</span>. up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">twice per Super Cast</span> to its maximum on-cast duration.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Duration</span> is initially <span style="color:#ffd966;">extended </span>by<span style="color:#ffd966;"> (The Saint Stacks + 1) seconds</span>, up to +20 seconds at <span style="color:#a481e1;">14 stacks</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Extending </span>it a <span style="color:#ffd966;">second time</span> <span style="color:#e06666;">reduces the gains</span> to <span style="color:#ffd966;">1 second per stack</span>, up to +10 seconds at <span style="color:#a481e1;">10 stacks</span>.</td><td class="s16">Lunafaction Boots</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZE8KmSfpY57W0vGzVY9oPGfd1KP_azIaqa6ZuofQUxchCe_HHdIXMrqTzawF1YTtBX42J_ISsSqLOlTnNzTduSCEHH7tBk7nqLLXENasc5YrTUzbvlR8St8OPqBcQwzkpkRUcdYDUqfeQFNTp0N86-AMXu1egNig=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s17" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">For </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">wearer </span><span style="font-style:italic;">and </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">standing on Rifts </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">and </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Well of Radiances </span><span style="font-style:italic;">cast by the </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">wearer</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+100 Reload Speed and 0.9x Reload Duration Multiplier.<br><span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Empowering Rifts</span> and <span style="color:#fdd24d;">Well of Radiances </span>grant <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">100%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[50%]</span> Increased Damage Falloff Distance.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Effect persists even after swapping off of the Exotic.</span><br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">For </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Primary Weapons</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while hipfiring:<br></span>+5 Range, +30 Stability,<br>-30% Accuracy Cone Size, <span style="color:#f1c232;">+2?° Precision Angle Threshold</span>,<br>20% Increased Aim Assist and Damage Falloff Distance.<br><span style="font-size:8pt;color:#e06666;"> </span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#e06666;">DMT, Last Word, and Tommy&#39;s Matchbook do not receive the Falloff bonuses, and receive uniquely tweaked Accuracy values. </span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R61" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">62</div></th><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXLY3ZdSLqdX3ag2WMT7juHLEguZh_--vflHKgjX2Vly77T0LwdRwRsFeCdsMWhZxB0KeRLGmiJ3XsFkPvkHHC8CRUtui5PmgJBh2HdOk0LmHYhuTcFKshUQxiiOxmPd73_Ahf_AUf6If8bGfKl-NphCHv-nRNj0nG0Lho=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX49mmyHM9KwBe8AHBq0jmTJoTKjcILg9nS52fxL3U4s4TwDeEY5SOhx1b5SyPO6I8EX4AdmRQ0fxmC7aofwnXADpnBwyIS0q1U2hkSPzo42nTW7gfmttSKnAI2lIGbx35YPDuwoCVmt7ytt5kSs5nvWsynzwYb87v9250=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYHOFByAUmzbvXGqOqE9YGTO8yvtVdC0bPNh30wAMDKWuEKM94BhkHTnhaxp8B9ozKGqW-NYIGYID6sjNXmURFe5ML7D2RAlohQYw0jiihPGMZUn1aerCWRVI99h_4BuVQSwngxcVWHk_FjZ4FMM4ExIMJY21B5C7bn=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R62" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">63</div></th><td class="s34">Cross Counter</td><td class="s35">Starless Night</td><td class="s23">Alchemical Etchings</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R63" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">64</div></th><td class="s10">Lucky Pants</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZQsVNdaXeW3I91bZSq3UqLngFa0PtauQTUHPm7oe_vJUirWBv35BVg4iNApFKD2URaXD4X5Ajxa_7hF6wH607Yt20O-8kw992T-qym7vA2DqtDi5lbkQM8i4GK4Qs0ldqzwNGJIHEoDu6HaPFw0P41UykzY-Gd9lXr=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s59" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Hand Cannon is readied</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span> <span style="font-style:italic;">+</span>20 Airborne Effectiveness, and increases Slide Distance from 6.5m to 8.5m.<span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br><br>Upon readying a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Hand Cannon</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Illegally Modded Holster</span> for 6 seconds.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Direct Hits against Combatants</span> grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">stacks</span> of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Illegally Modded Holster</span>, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#ffd966;">10 stacks</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Illegally Modded Holster </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is removed upon readying a non-Hand Cannon.</span><br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Illegally Modded Holster</span>:<br>+100 Ready Speed Handling, 0.6x Ready Duration Multiplier, and -30% Accuracy Cone Size.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">45%</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">increased Direct Impact damage against Combatants </span>per <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>, up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">450%</span> at <span style="color:#ffd966;">10 stacks</span>.<br><span style="color:#63d275;">Uncivil Discourse</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span>receives <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">30% increased Direct Impact Damage </span>per <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Sturm&#39;s Overcharged Rounds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Hawkmoon&#39;s Paracausal Shot</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, and all other </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">non-direct damage is not increased</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Bosses take 33% decreased damage from Lucky Pants buffed shots.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Illegally Modded Holster</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">expires</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">stowing,</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> if </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Illegally Modded Holster stacks</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> were at </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">x7 </span><span style="font-style:italic;">or higher</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Applies <span style="color:#e06666;">Out of Luck</span> for 10 seconds, <span style="color:#e06666;">preventing Illegally Modded Holster from being activated</span>.</td><td class="s38">Hoarfrost-Z</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLY1GhioBviyjaevczW3-qOCaIEBeDEBiGNNRIxFMSBxduemSrhLf2Lf0QkFazS5yBMArfi9cguFOrwDxcaReY2AmTPnEqBn-ZnLEamh1CpwD5sufQwQYSX-qAT9TlHakYywEDEKLSCd-tlfvtix44lH39Vps_fmAw=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s60" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is equipped:<br></span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Abilities</span> now spawn <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Crystals</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Rally and Towering Barricades </span>are replaced by <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Glacial Fortification</span>.<br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Glacial Fortification </span>is composed of <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">4 medium crystals</span>, and a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">small crystal</span> in the middle.<br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Glacial Fortification</span> Inherits <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Rally Barricade</span> Bonuses, even if <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">no crystals</span> remain.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Overrides Barricade Cooldown with Towering Barricade&#39;s.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Thruster Usage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Spawns <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">2 Stasis Crystals</span> in a V formation ahead of the user.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does not receive Rally Barricade bonuses, nor does it override the cooldown.</span></td><td class="s13">Mataiodoxía</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXYRy-YG7mu_YqGl2iiK9tUoFlnbXVEhp3Or1V20UHGN7_badc7wFhfdqmeFwUwMKu45n8f66iLu9Iow8G7MAL4sb_XdUGjcDp1_PMXFzV87P64abqHsj73xtcnUB_rBiS2hr5l8kK3qeeFVmAYhnEJEuC6PjWIbBUfJQ=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s57" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#63d275;">Arcane Needles</span> become <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Shield-Piercing</span>. <br>Scoring an <span style="color:#63d275;">Arcane Needle </span>hit on an enemy applies a <span style="color:#e06666;">♢mark </span>for 10 seconds.<br><br>Grants<span style="color:#89cdd1;"> Melee Ability Energy</span> upon scoring an <span style="color:#63d275;">Arcane Needle Kill </span>or <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspended Enemy</span> Kill.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T1 Combatant </span>=<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">15%</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> | T2 </span>=<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">22.2%</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> | T3 </span>=<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">33%</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> | T4 </span>=<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">100%</span> | <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardian </span>=<span style="color:#ea9999;"> </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">33%<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Marked Enemy Death:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"><br></span>Target triggers a <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspending Burst</span>.<br>Deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">269 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[40]</span> <span style="color:#63d275;">Strand </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Ability Damage</span><span style="color:#63d275;"> </span>and inflicts <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspension </span>to enemies within 6 meters.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#63d275;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;">Upon scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">2 Arcane Needle </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">hits on a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Marked Enemy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Target triggers a <span style="color:#63d275;">stronger Suspending Explosion</span>. <br>Deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">538 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#63d275;">Strand </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Ability Damage</span><span style="color:#63d275;"> </span>and inflicts <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspension </span>to enemies within 10 meters.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">5 Needlestorm Hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> against a single enemy:<br></span>Target triggers a <span style="color:#63d275;">larger and more damaging Suspending Explosion</span>.<br>Deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">5,040 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#63d275;">Strand </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Ability Damage</span> and inflicts <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspension </span>to enemies within 10 meters.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R64" style="height: 69