nherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arcbolt Grenades</span> are now able to chain an additional time, damaging up to 5 enemies.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arcbolt Grenades</span> inflict <span style="color:#76a5af;">Jolt</span> to the first target hit.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">inflicting </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#76a5af;">Jolt</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#e0a261;">15% Arcbolt Grenade Ability Energy</span>. <br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">triggering </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#76a5af;">Jolt chain damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#e0a261;">7.5% Arcbolt Grenade Ability Energy</span>.</td><td class="s38">Icefall Mantle</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbIhjgpuwj3RRtaBXDXpG_s8k6LqESYV3RJCPWx135VYTsVHf5L7OwSpP_UlS7nFA0exI4PmteOSRO2jSm3-2sopvZkkQN9GaZEOXZ6d_haZTmBw-Udoxg-gtWX0ZQ1Qxu2PVF--KMlg98sUc0is9Cli6WPPCoK0QqP=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s60" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is equipped:<br><br></span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restores 10 HP</span> per <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Frost Armor</span> gained.<span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span>Scoring <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">2 Stasis Kills</span> within 3 seconds of each grants a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Frost Armor</span>. <br><br>Replaces <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Barricade Class Abilities </span>with <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Glacial Guard.</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> <br>Overwrites Barricade Cooldown to 70 seconds.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br>On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Glacial Guard</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Cast</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">maximum Frost Armor stacks</span> to the <span style="color:#ffd966;">user</span>.<br>Inflicts <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">x100</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [x40]</span> <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Slow </span>to enemies within ? meters.</td><td class="s46">Mantle of Battle Harmony</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZN-rRDcvITGFAT2iMULK7m_8kOskGP_-A24FCsYWCORbrPUZOGhfTPLTD7uIvtM-82C2_NSXUoiq7g70g_t7eB51K99_-catvcPu7p6_QeYuuW6Mzy88V77CspAQaWY3nK4WH0Sy8ut_tsLQXwsEH9j7iknw_tO2K_=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s61" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super-Element </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Matching Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> or </span><span style="font-style:italic;">5 </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super-Element </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Matching Weapon Damage Instances</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> 3 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">each</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, up to </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">once per second</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Triggers <span style="color:#ffd966;">Energy Siphon</span>, granting <span style="color:#ffd966;">additional Super Energy</span> up to<span style="color:#e06666;"> once every ? seconds</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Energy Siphon </span>grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">x4 Super-Matching </span><span style="color:#6d9eeb;">Weapon Surge</span> for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">11 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[6]</span> seconds if <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span> is charged.<br><span style="color:#e06666;">Energy Siphon will, at times, fail to trigger on </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar Supers</span><span style="color:#e06666;"> if they&#39;re charged.<br></span><br>By Kills: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Tier 1 Combatant</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">1.5%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T2 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">2%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T3 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">?% </span>| <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T4 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">2.5%</span> | <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardian </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">2.5?%</span><br>By Damage: <span style="color:#ffd966;">?% Super Ability Energy</span><br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability End</span>:<br>x4 <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc</span>, <span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar</span>, <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void</span>, <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis</span>, and <span style="color:#63d275;">Strand </span><span style="color:#6d9eeb;">Weapon Surge</span> for 10 seconds.<br>Grants <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Harmonic Munitions</span> for 15 seconds.<br><br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Harmonic Munitions:<br></span>Dealing <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super-Matching</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> Weapon Damage</span> triggers a <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super-Matching</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> Explosion</span> on the target.<br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Detonation </span>deals up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">180</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Damage </span>over 6 meters, down to a minimum of 50% damage.<br><span style="color:#e06666;">Can only trigger up to one detonation per second. </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Harmonic Munition Kills </span>trigger <span style="color:#ffd966;">Energy Siphon</span><span style="color:#e06666;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R67" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">68</div></th><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWrocZI5yXLcQaUT2ZRiu3g0VkxdwtnjX6A-XyEYnrTkXD-L_RFsQ-fc8lApRHGGz-dYc7duWKKir0j6_yXQp0WE6yAtJU003dKbzrE4W8YVsg4hxrNFZucGAsE7Rn6DV31bmryKNoSUuseYwTV3hGAwScM2VLOJFARKA=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s41"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUbCixvRQ1JilDqXSevAYOtNLmk1K2jKB3U3bSMKgZMsE5ZTupO_2jG5aqf9Wv7oPI1vIHy1huFuWjUIb1ttV9yPAW9gqMiOHAWywVuTxygITTWmzBAr2O6uIMUUG4BDRBdlBVlz8MrLSW5Cv_CYtwoasesMvzGevr4Ydg=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s49"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLamF45jW_BAYVgacEKDN3MORGcPd6Gczm8dKKVieHlqOGwE5OFViKDM5Zvmgk2R0zjZVPX7E3jV92S5Mdx5koYFFM4j77LdA6zICRLUmEByF6rF_PPVosX9-PFEwVauvPyQD5spjbx5yZH2oYlTOwJB946PzLF1ODPl=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R68" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">69</div></th><td class="s34">Probability Matrix</td><td class="s43">Glacial Guard</td><td class="s50">Absorption Cells</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R69" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">70</div></th><td class="s38">Mask of Bakris</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa6kU21WIKsmGKdOrVsMZO2uMOWNtE4f2WaTP92ml1QTtdgCCQ4MJc3a5QXjnYk5FsL8qc1-6bTenWb5MtCiMZpseD1-gp49zs9q9YXMSfVOBuZk4WoHKMkBeW40lD8tYl_9yGNwtcz1vi7s2g_zAc5-plR9c4Y9A=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s60" rowspan="3"><span style="font-style:italic;">While an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Arc</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> is equipped:<br></span>Replaces <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Dodge</span> with <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Shift.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does not replace </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Acrobat&#39;s Dodge</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">. Overrides Cooldown and Chunk Scalar to Marksman&#39;s Dodge.</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"><br></span><br><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Performs a quick shift that moves the <span style="color:#ffd966;">user </span>up to 12 meters away, rendering them invisible and invulnerable for the duration of the shift.<span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span>Grants a stack of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Light Shift</span> for 11 seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#ffd966;">3 stacks</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Light Shift:</span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x1</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span>=<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> 10% </span>|<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">x2</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span>=<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> 21% </span>|<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">x3</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> = 33%</span> increased <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc</span>, <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis</span>, and <span style="color:#ffd966;">Lord of Wolves</span> Weapon Damage.<br> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10%</span> Increased Weapon Damage against <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Debuffed Enemies</span>.<br>Weapon Kills grant <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">60% Class Ability Energy</span> while active.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Damage buffs stack with other buffs.</span></td><td class="s24">Khepri&#39;s Horn</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXZVJmfvHTx6MsApmjsfkfTE_a67PymXJMn6uWAQYaqHkSMQIxxFDnhZBQmmOgK6lQyxR_EGT1B1aLCaizvChwtxdRpkbnuHMfxgounjjJDq-rI4J-hAPb5T7NU9idifz0ZOuUAeQfc_hqgg1QWeyA_MvCCKqlApCqepg=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s52" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Solar Kills</span> grant <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">15% Class Ability Energy.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 1? second cooldown between </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Solar Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"> granting </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Energy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">.</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"><br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Barricade Placement</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, while a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Solar </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">equipped</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;"><br></span>Unleashes 3 <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Tracking Solar Wave</span> up to 18.5 metres away.<br><br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar Waves</span>:<br>Each deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">480 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[100]</span> damage and inflicts <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">x60</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">+30 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[x30</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">+15</span><span style="color:#ea9999;">]</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Scorch</span>. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Damage cannot overlap.</span><br><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Solar Waves</span> spawn a <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Sunspot </span>under the enemies on <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">hit</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[kill]</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Solar Wave</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">do not benefit from, nor trigger</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Roaring Flames</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br><br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar Effects</span> triggered by <span style="color:#e0a261;">Khepri&#39;s Solar Waves</span> lose their<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> 3x PVE bonus</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">This means </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ff9900;">Ignitions</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> deal </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">66.7% decreased damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br></span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Also, due to some wonkiness regarding </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Sunspot scorch</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, it takes ~5.3 seconds to </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ff9900;">ignite </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">without </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Ashes</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, and ~1 second with </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Ashes</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td><td class="s62">Necrotic Grip</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ4JJ-9xiVqZA1XRHetorHMM_-7AO9q59YKHy9zUa4NEMPMx7o3jUSHrLxv79KWQ3Z8oFgWK2rZ2M8mZaiP8zqeLeE0WI6dK8u7VRtNgiQDs9gyp2p-6AGYCeLsY7h2Km-VxFmaPJ1GOTkqZFntwOvr36LgFFganBM7=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s63" rowspan="3">Passively grants +30 Airborne Effectiveness to<span style="color:#b6d7a8;"> Weapons of Sorrow.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b6d7a8;"><br></span><span style="color:#79bec3;">Melee Hits</span><span style="color:#b6d7a8;"> </span>inflict<span style="color:#6aa84f;"> Potent Corruption.<br>Corrupted enemies spread Potent Corruption on death in a 5 metre radius.<br><br>Potent Corrupted Damage </span>ticks every <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">0.52</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[0.7]</span> seconds up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">19 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> times over <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [?]</span> seconds, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">32 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[5?]</span> <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage </span>every tick, totalling <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">1366 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> damage over its duration.<br><br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Potent Corruption Damage deals more damage every tick, increasing by 11% per tick for the first 14 ticks, then increasing by an average of 41% per tick for the last 5 ticks.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Reapplying Potent Corruption will reset the ramping damage.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R70" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">71</div></th><td class="s41"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbQAj4rY4xbjViQHOl9hOyKv08bX6j7bKXdJyzXo0O-qera7UQtsCak3cIZgmgP0u3HUBchVhiN0fgULVj_1otsyucggj3L0_aJ031_cfxvysnI_h