n><span style="font-style:italic;"> hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> and </span><span style="font-style:italic;">bounces</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Spawns a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Small Stasis Crystal</span> on the 1st and 3rd bounce.<br>Grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">7.5% Fixed Melee</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Ability Energy</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#3c78d8;">shattering </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Crystal</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> with a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Withering Blade</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Releases<span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> 3 Stasis Projectiles</span> spread out 120° near the <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Crystal</span>.<br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Projectiles</span> spawn a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Small Crystal</span> on impact.</td><td class="s66">Lion Rampant</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb9bhUab9VDok7NpjQQC89IDuq5UOKDZiIfkyLSVUfzub2KJUUi5GJVX9g12yZlhsrjkG5Kww5hGkbWQPydYaur1qlzp5V59nFCTC9exvWPmT8mub2dRtL7sB4uR03ZXp7RUXyv6XMZDfH2EDrSyKSH6GqdekcgbEz2=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s37" rowspan="3">Enables hipfiring and ADS while in Lift, and passively grants +50 Airborne Effectiveness.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span>Increases <span style="color:#e6b8af;">Lift Duration</span> to 4 seconds.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e6b8af;">Lift Duration in seconds:<br>High Lift: 2.6 -&gt; 4 (54% increase)<br>Strafe Lift: 2.2 -&gt; 4 (82% increase)<br>Catapult Lift: 1 -&gt; 4 (300% increase)<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">For </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Primary Weapons</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while hipfiring:<br></span>+5 Range, +30 Stability,<br>-30% Accuracy Cone Size, <span style="color:#f1c232;">+2?° Precision Angle Threshold</span>,<br>20% Increased Aim Assist and Damage Falloff Distance.<br><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#e06666;"> DMT, Last Word, and Tommy&#39;s Matchbook do not receive the Falloff bonuses, and receive uniquely tweaked Accuracy values. </span></td><td class="s28">Nezarec&#39;s Sin</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYOjUOLrvoDBN9_Uc0xtjNCgwThXrNZbKkot-GDWPWI7YZGDtrVDCPSG4juG0ACk50X2APOCdHRCxZ485pPXAoq9zuq7fqdxj2yMGMrd2rY5I3xfT6r-2MxONOJW02fBuX5wXvU_RV0vMbL706YHCnL_6FO89sp2Na1=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s48" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void Damage Kills</span> grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">Abyssal Extractors</span> for <span style="color:#ffd966;">2.5 seconds</span>, up to a maximum of<span style="color:#ffd966;"> 20 seconds</span><span style="font-style:italic;">.<br></span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Soul Siphon Kills</span> and <span style="color:#8e7cc3;">Suppressed Enemy</span> <span style="color:#8e7cc3;">Kills </span>with <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void Damage</span><span style="color:#8e7cc3;"> </span>extend <span style="color:#ffd966;">Abyssal Extractors duration</span> by <span style="color:#ffd966;">+1.5 seconds</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Soul Siphon hits </span>inflict <span style="color:#8e7cc3;">Suppression </span>for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[5]</span> seconds. <br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Abyssal Extractor</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><br></span>300% Additional Base <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span>and <span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Melee </span>Regeneration Rate.<br>200% Additional Base <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span>and <span style="color:#f1c232;">Super </span>Regeneration Rate.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R73" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">74</div></th><td class="s41"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWUpJv-gBjd4ixxxbsmR3wEQxj4XbtqR6ypctRFJ2ov_-SVzOzp3LArJQqb45FlCSe7ictDojr611ypMInKsd7iuQ6GeJwd845vOn3LyjpyU_GEz3P3UjNt157b3iwg9KtF1jZg-wkbgpDdsOmb4vqy3T4-dHtjRA76PA=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUPfimZSsQReIBk2Mm1Lq2bdqNgT4dWH6Bg39q3J8Ss5gsM23HmsEB_j8lN7AucmCU6B-XGZiWuCKqNU6PjP2tqkyxgFMfBdocRFcD1gAEb-UILbXMwd84vnRIQXi-S-aPvcJtXKpTX8r5Wrwvfhd6JuaIbYv27gXWE7JA=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYqP5yk97j9LaEoT6o6Zuavl2OUhb2UDwAd4CDONKQhGV-4XlgE8r9FsPussqdCfPZzpkOSagGj5yETgCJnUYlM7anvwHhAnDF0OAXjt5zyzIPCkenQfsfGyaN1M5HIR_CwRNy0sYKvwYcQMy7h4WzVpplLBu-vu7H2=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;