g.<br>Sidearm Kills refresh 3 seconds.</td><td class="s24">Loreley Splendor</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV4q2GHmGmiYAUgNWR47d7nwRlFyDbvm6cv8LG5BuPsFBPHou7FhtHL_7J1m6AK-bmAADabvKiiY1c4HeDqPWcaZXpWfAOKbREY_a-OS0mj5YM8BeIKqe-5M3PmlM0vdgdD_mvH7Xk8JcSZ8FBpLSPbs9xWI0wYtxVOcoY=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Solar </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is equipped:<br><br>Upon either reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Critical Health</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> if </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability is charged </span><span style="font-style:italic;">or on </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage while Rally or Towering Barricade is equipped</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Spawns a <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Sunspot </span>under the user. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Consumes a</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">if it&#39;s triggered by </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Critical Health</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">The </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Sunspot </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">spawned grants </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Sol Invictus</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> even without the </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Aspect </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">equipped. <br>However, the </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Sunspot</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> duration cannot be extended without it.</span></td><td class="s28">Nothing Manacles</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYOCL4yrVtPV2njrdeOSFUovAzcyTnAyQs8uXbodeNK1KwwavE79gMV6p1QW2WLyCqeqZR148KF7H6UBJRzXpz-ZRiF-rdeWmz_66RD-P9QS2Td-lZj_oVkVRqkrD3PryQmdP4mp4QfZyrJi50f_tmPN9HvMNrfg08T=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s48" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Grants an extra Scatter Grenade Ability Charge.<br><br>Scatter Grenades Submunitions</span> receive <span style="color:#ffd966;">drastically improved tracking and speed</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Scatter Grenade Kills</span> spawn <span style="color:#bba5f3;">3 additional Scatter Submunitions</span>.<br><span style="color:#e06666;">Additional Scatter Submunitions cannot trigger more explosions.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R76" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">77</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ4ULNXCZIC6mG0RScwDEEJgExgp-1xNPu9nXwR6Sllv7Lp2X1zJU7vz6Rh4sjNokUH5QxGrfVShPDxia4B7utoVZ12XArRjK_8iGEltGj_cKcUU8luoGcwvPcNnPnF1h9Zv6U2FlU9ykYrZqTmc_ZQIxb5b5fqmlBd=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV5oFgZAkZDrhnGdYBtaZxKduPKBr4kD_b0c9xbQTlpyj8LIicfLXtxVEGeL3MLR2qeSRk1oLJFv0tjHy8r8Os_EVMWlE9QyoWho7MzKU4pHjRt7U2HhzzWYsTrAz_OaH9mDcomCxmV1g01oi-F7UhJn25GqZtZZ6Mhgs4=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb9d4pEfV_yN8rFE4pklEdg1eNvOJvJQflyPspmD1Sg5pJcBadv0q1DROILVksy9C7yhhcJ2skKDSnxCQBL8yZyjLTX6w56pgrixb91XalBXt9Y63D3RE9NdqmYmmgVjAgwp5QsmWmtQ4zmfi_h3cmkFQjf4xpNPHxv=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R77" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">78</div></th><td class="s21">Spring-Loaded Mounting</td><td class="s33">Cauterizing Flame</td><td class="s35">Scatter Charge</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R78" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">79</div></th><td class="s13">Moirai</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVAPzoCdmA76zm2_G0jPg0wP86TDuYBTWI363YN6iQfaiT1_WMwG3v0zikR8PpCzoEgFpIJLejH3An1EeLT2PDgg4sdT-jOVqUIhTvWFv_TXK65OQO5fJPAojjOkrrC1fFZAe4c2-Fx3OtvCkn3wJmNWHK2LesNPxO24g=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s15" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#63d275;">Threaded Spike</span> can now bounce to <span style="color:#93c47d;">Tangles</span>, detonating them and immediately returning.<br>Detonating a <span style="color:#93c47d;">Tangle </span>with <span style="color:#63d275;">Threaded Spike</span> and catching it automatically picks up a Tangle.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">Collecting the Tangle this way counts for Elemental Pickup interactions.<br><br></span><span style="color:#e06666;">Failing to catch</span> the aforementioned <span style="color:#63d275;">Threaded Spike</span> triggers a <span style="color:#63d275;">Strand Explosion</span> around the user.<br><span style="color:#63d275;">Strand Explosion</span> deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">727 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#63d275;">Strand </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Damage</span> over 9 meters with no falloff.<br><span style="color:#e06666;">Failure Explosion</span> scales with <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Damage Buffs and triggers Melee Interactions.<br></span><span style="color:#e06666;">Failure Explosion</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> </span><span style="color:#e06666;">does NOT count</span> as <span style="color:#93c47d;">Tangle damage</span>.<br><br>Catching a <span style="color:#63d275;">Threaded Spike</span> that doesn&#39;t hit a <span style="color:#93c47d;">Tangle </span>refunds an additional <span style="color:#89cdd1;">25% Melee Ability Energy</span>, <span style="color:#e06666;">unaffected </span>by <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Stat</span>.</td><td class="s28">Mask of the Quiet One</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUNpXXmnnwwVEsKbV9Vqfdo6hF8CaDUUhuqh3HRb2qyaVPgIZzByIawNprSIr0cOxo3U6I7ACjHOQJGvvyK1Ym1efDCcIO7fA7fvs6uIse2Pd31GjrWizozrhP5sWJyeJIuNDfPk-ALHFHNlNMCOK2I15p_kqtUICv4Xg=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s48" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">receiving damage </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">from an enemy:<br></span>Grants 5% <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade</span>, <span style="color:#79bec3;">Melee</span>,<span style="color:#79bec3;"> </span>and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span>Ability Energy.<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 1 second cooldown between activations.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Void </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is equipped:<br>Upon scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3 kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">5 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">each</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">kill </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while at </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Critical Health</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#8e7cc3;">Devour</span> for 5<span style="font-size:7pt;color:#b4a7d6;">+2.5</span> seconds.</td><td class="s16">Ophidian Aspect</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUTkT5RlNRGScv41MfB5Gh3EnpvbHPwBNHljgp9UikEDVbNnSNlkZjeZvC2Ddb6BhEJzHUoK5-3o31mUskN_MAhBFR_C3rTE-7doEc__k6RkL07UmcZV9MkJ2e4pi4GDehw9GwncMlyDXthn0iowjyI2TLwLk6Ais-r8A=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s17" rowspan="3">Passively grants +35 Handling, +35 Reload Speed, and +10 Airborne Effectiveness.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R79" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">80</div></th><td class="s19"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVsRJCmpycmTgR3uxq2iDSKBSFZYLFviGKCYDTsGqwZ8otiA14HMu9nTTZPkyVqOc67ZEQpwNaOaRAvKf_OuA5r9DZGMhapPHbgHYW1YEibDdWipfupzFQ21srBjzK64_AlEG4R3clq3Ji-vdrnDNwbnDgVTLd65MxuCQ=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXPH6lUKw2TpVeSTKLuMmC4w3zIzFpRUs_CQEsoacY4bKWUGu1sLqEYhHKZzU7q_IG7rSUXjgavcAIPIomoMeo7v_j05svvTT7-5_q9Ec5Uwe054fO2KIb-Dv70hqqXjeCoshRlsZyg5yUSLGPAkhFIUTki4O7cbcqg5g=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZskEzkSqIFzXiL3JtdJ9C0QqJrhKgYjVMLT7S1MBPI8sPbJe9_d9IwqJMsyETVEpAN5dK_MD3krTUAlb_RLremTPY8aw1kngfuvYmfVnoylTEvgG_Gi6gWTKOdAUWOiEshBbR0DXiTM2AEC0L0SmntDP8okuimZRlV=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R80" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">81</div></th><td class="s22">Webcatcher</td><td class="s35">Dreaded Visage</td><td class="s23">Cobra Totemic</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R81" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">82</div></th><td class="s10">Mothkeeper’s Wraps</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWxy-opyIy8QR9reUEWm6hKtPygrjJEByBltJRJp3ox5ntC1iL09f7IeaoxNmuuwjXZv68mnRrP3DszVYPmWqMkMHDmSO8cXXlADMEQnM0hioJJpFJi7kRI5FDL5iqUDXIUdQqmz2Np08ZTQQPMYQd1TBDc4Hg7rr6BMgU=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s67" rowspan="3">Kills grant charges of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Winged Eclipse Ready</span>, up to a <span style="color:#ffd966;">maximum of 6</span>.<span style="font-weight:normal;"><br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-and-File</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">1</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">2</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Miniboss+</span> and <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">3</span><br>When fully charged, grants <span style="color:#e0a261;">2 Grenade Charges</span> of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Winged Eclipse</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 6 second cooldown upon throwing the last moth cage before Winged Eclipse can be charged.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Winged Eclipse</span>:<br>Releases <span style="color:#ffd966;">2 Moths</span> on impact. <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Moth Element</span> <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">changes </span>depending on the closest 2 targets within 20 meters.<br>If there are no targets within 20 meters, they default to <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void Moths</span>.<br><br>Releases an <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Moth</span> if the closest target is an enemy, pursuing at ~10m/s and detonating on contact.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Moths</span> deal up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">473 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[31 Guardians | 201 Constructs]</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Damage</span> and <span style="color:#999999;">blind</span> over a 4 meter radius<span style="color:#999999;">.</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#999999;"><br></span>Releases a <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void Moth</span> if the closest target is an <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allied Guardian</span>.<br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void Moths</span> chase their <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>at ~25m/s, bestowing <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">22.5 Void Overshield HP </span>on contact.</td><td class="s24">Melas Panoplia</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVaWoAMuHCe8BmOO4JLzvEvYLBqT34hNBk175YIG7J6LhCqdHxwMD6AeDQbXf0sJ8qwPfHnYZtyfTFA5wyv5zPiaC6emk2Bu02tgGXPAqtiumk7_bD7yjg6MmgiLu97BQGPdlEkMjp3VWcQ5QE1C1yOed5xHb4LTrAxvEI=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">collecting </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f9cb9c;">Firesprite</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">3 Solar Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">each</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Forge Master</span> for 12 seconds. Buff timer begins ticking once a <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Throwing Hammer</span> is used.<br><br>Initially activating <span style="color:#ffd966;">Forge Master</span> grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">11.7% Fixed Melee Energy</span> for 8 seconds.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Forge Master</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Allows <span style="color:#ffd966;">recalling </span>the <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Throwing Hammer</span> by pressing <span style="color:#89cdd1;">[Melee]</span>, <span style="color:#89cdd1;">fully refunding</span> it.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Throwing Hammer</span> tracking is improved.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Recalling </span>after 2? seconds of scoring a <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Throwing Hammer hit</span> performs a <span style="color:#ffd966;">Perfect Recall</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Perfect Recall</span> triggers an <span style="color:#e0a261;">explosion </span>that deals up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">290</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Damage </span>over ~5 meters.<br><br>Performing <span style="color:#ffd966;">Perfect Recalls</span> and picking up additional <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Firesprites </span>extends the buff duration by <span style="color:#ffd966;">3 seconds</span>, up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">12 seconds</span>.</td><td class="s38">Osmiomancy Gloves</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLadzRYooigYBd7n9MyqcqSd1sr4sbz63FBWqENWSWrFclhazdJg0vJrSreFXniOdqgX6gH6lNnU1MLimzpBQ4O8odd7XrfRR_SGwL_HSBypGvkqBz2nxnVpYIB52jW97ugQAymnO_h7fPKgps-r7DWrxaRF59iOIDcb=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s60" rowspan="3">Grants an extra <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Coldsnap </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Charge.<br></span><br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Enhanced Coldsnap Grenades:<br></span>Stronger tracking.<br>Travel 17.5% further and faster.<br>Grant <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Energy </span>upon dealing damage. <br><br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Coldsnap </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Energy:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Tier 1 Combatant</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span>=<span style="color:#e0a261;"> 10% </span>|<span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T2</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span>=<span style="color:#e0a261;"> 22% </span>|<span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T3</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span>=<span style="color:#e0a261;"> 34% </span>|<span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T4</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span>=<span style="color:#e0a261;"> 50% </span>|<span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardian</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span>=<span style="color:#e0a261;"> 7%</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R82" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">83</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVi-tgY_1s44Ol_AWDVbfHib_6Bm6lNBOIN44aeS0_wDTClPtUr4Fd023bF0RKHhxgLCRw1pswfqXxJBlYXAojEK57-XTbIEpjjvt-2S0NqmUwPL-GqW2pkWHf_emq5awAaaR3oLluDGx-o1jSitNz_TubRN4PrvlK4RX8=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXszbCgLGdF0ZMUnnlig4bBN7Us12BxfBbsf5ODYniBmXGSvJf1MsfWy3VIbFYiTopRCGFil-VZowKGxD-n2H-LAxDomaIYJc1YgceSeofqlEBXYAwxNRtcjpiKPIWrrSaQfVrP486Ffm9gwCLz9zv2yzjHDhKlsspV64g=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s41"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZq4Dwq0Jq_vHMUX0v8xFhC58Xd8E1uARhnfjq8JGuRTNHP2QAdEW7RrdwX27LevJalZOd-7_B4miaKLbuEKqKjDUvlMwPPW6vjvtYUvU0ZuRP43cTk7y2Y1sKIoIKR_gwcOjuC46f7h-u3SEBdGop1y8CKRXSujQ=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R83" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">84</div></th><td class="s21">Winged Eclipse</td><td class="s33">Forge Master</td><td class="s43">Fervid Coldsnap</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R84" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">85</div></th><td class="s10">Oathkeeper</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYD0UcFkF5d-vXM8wGo_KUgD5Z42uvuBuWxmBjSTkrigmC2AHwWhWA9F2POJ5-zgkzk7r8vvJmw9X72mC-Rm2wA7NFz4iMgsSiwBny3mRPgtxROb1xfMGBdfdLoIHh_LYHKpmioOlzZnrjlOPaI_n8SrDw_WYYTg_8V=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s12" rowspan="3">Passively grants +40 Airborne Effectiveness and +10 Draw Time to Bows.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">+10 Draw Time is equivalent to Draw Time Masterwork.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span>Bows can hold <span style="color:#ffd966;">perfect draws indefinitely.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;">0.35 seconds </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;">full draw </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">on a</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Primary Ammo</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> Bow:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">increased damage</span> every 0.5 seconds, up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">200% increased impact damage against</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Combatants </span>after 2 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Broadhead</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Poison</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Crystals</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Dragonfly/Explosive Head, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">and others are not affected.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Damage Buff</span> disappears after holding full draw for 4 seconds.</td><td class="s36">Mk. 44 Stand Asides</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZhzx-xOMPc_utmOJVpIErfhoWKTQsGG3dbgFkKLVAnwHYIboCZmUz3P6IvpMdFHGYhLhYwLChV6BR0CsStQtXH8YHfPojCFMgYNvglZAj66i6BF0ye5GN_Smr82wV7m6xhz3EN1ZOe5hjRHG5NzMjjtPFewCCNqmtq=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s37" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Juggernaut&#39;s Shield</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is active:<br></span>Grants a stack of <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Bolt Charge</span> every 1.5 seconds.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Speed Booster</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is active:<br></span>Creates an area behind the user that grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Speed Booster</span>.</td><td class="s24">Phoenix Protocol</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xW1bDprwzwVtOtIzqzT02u4vcMJdwaAcbZjeZ4OtwzV5xPj2JkYDgDtYGbBpbjE_MYyEZQ76nOzXJCI7a2D0cUNj3DzsPiOPAJ2p74ejF-doqoWY8lyMfXSR3Q6-DrzLeZbOjHZxu3HX6Nc4p4-PMgm81Sj5oRYSYy_WAw=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While inside your </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Well of Radiance</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, while under </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">50% Super Energy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, and if your </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Well of Radiance</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> <br></span>Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">10% Super Energy</span> per kill. <br><br>Amount of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Energy</span> gained is decreased by <span style="color:#ffd966;">1.5%</span> for each successive kill, down to a minimum of <span style="color:#ffd966;">4% Super Energy </span>per kill.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">10% -&gt; 8.5% -&gt; 7% -&gt; 5% -&gt; 4.5% -&gt; 4% -&gt; 4%...</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R85" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">86</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbXgtOalelvt98wWGKIm0TaZAhEscLGaZgrbsd0uJn_3Xiqs96zSuz9WevhNv80BUSt10dxQBAjb