pan><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Void Invisibility </span>grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">50%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[10%] </span>Damage Resist <span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Resist x4)</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Upon bestowing an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">ally </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">with </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Void Invisibility</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#79bec3;">50% Melee Ability Energy</span> per <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">ally </span>made <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">invisible</span>, up to <span style="color:#89cdd1;">200%</span> with <span style="color:#9fc5e8;">4 allies</span>.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Allies</span> <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">begin Health Regeneration</span>.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Allies </span>share the Damage Resist Effect if made <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">invisible </span>by the<span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Omnioculus Wielder.</span><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Damage Resistance does not apply in Super.</span></td><td class="s46">No Backup Plans</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVqHNz2nYOHlvGUn23AUpytZJ4bOLvWSPn7AowsXJEQxIoQHbbAvCKkVqGlNNWTlYga-fq_pdKYh84pED2mhqOaNQmMRIfTNl1u_uhS4J5mCm4IupUNMjGvtLPTyJLustv_zCSDZX2l3kqx3TrrrCEULTwiZepYMDUGQw=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s53" rowspan="3">Passively grants +? Reload Speed and +30 Airborne Effectiveness to Shotguns.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;">100% Counter Progress</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> by scoring multiple </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Shotgun </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Melee </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Kills: <br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-And-File </span>=<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">34% </span>| <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite+</span> and <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians </span>=<span style="color:#ffd966;"> 50%</span><br> <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Begins Health Regeneration</span>.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Amplified</span><span style="font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration</span><span style="font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Void Overshield</span><span style="font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Frost Armor</span><span style="font-style:italic;">, or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;">Woven Mail</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">35%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[10%] </span>increased Shotgun damage.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">+30%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[+?%]</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Increased Melee Damage</span>.<br>Shotgun and <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee </span>Kills extend the buff duration effect by 5 seconds, up to their usual maximum.<br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Void Overshield</span> also receives <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">+15 HP</span> if active.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Increases Super Melee Damage by 30% as well, additive to Shieldcrush&#39;s +50%. <br>Includes: </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Fist of Havoc Light Attack</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> | </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Hammer of Sol Shrapnel</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> | </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Sentinel Shield Light Attack<br></span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Glacial Quake Light Attacks + Howl during Glacial Quake </span></td><td class="s24">Promethium Spurs</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbDF5ueGad-bjasiEc6IYnJJweRX5h0Tde_FNvuGuuV1_5Jp1jr8xSpr8uORIPiMavPBobfIl_AaKjWj4LRaPiobfW_b83BvZ0_InB7ua0Bcz5HSjfXPT4DtLOMdiYJgG3mvqZg5dlx-OGhG_j5nByarFPhh3zmZIk_=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Solar </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is equipped:<br></span><br>Weapon Kills grant <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Energy</span>, based on the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Enemy Rank</span>.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Tier 1 Combatant</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span>=<span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> 18% </span>| <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T2 </span>= <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">26%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T3</span> = <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">40%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T4</span> = <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">60%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Miniboss</span> = <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">80%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Boss </span>= <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">100% <br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians</span> = <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">30%<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while in </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Rift</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Healing Rift</span> | Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Radiant </span>for 6.5 seconds to the <span style="color:#ffd966;">user </span>and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>within 10 meters.<br><span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Empowering Rift</span> | Grants <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Cure x1</span> to the <span style="color:#ffd966;">user </span>and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>within 10 meters.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Well of Radiance and Daybreak Kills </span>grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">Radiant </span>and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Cure x2 </span>to the <span style="color:#ffd966;">user </span>and <span style="color:#9fc5e8;">allies </span>within 10 meters.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R88" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">89</div></th><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWNHzdomtUeUYtAaEs1myEnulpmNoUuhkbmKHvXDzDmZZ5LelmBxjUFVhshcZ2KXbOmCwegO0655UoqCbq3DE_oA72Y_9RBNkvDr6jxCwS7ba9oqLadLyq-Ibm0JqtiHaS1M2C2GTX1E_EJFS265C9axCjztI2yloNFSk8=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s49"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVWbqfAOCw4KIebHjkKXaQcb9KOqGGMVESIESmv8iQo3QArEOkqe0DEAbRzznPxsviz2aR0e19YDuMG2NSBxyNuQoJ8xcZfBpiyRUu1Zva3YFdG0l_e7vIlt3getbwK5H9y5FWKPPPYDCmTn5Tu_6sTNgmB9lqzTyWIUi8=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZo8T_FaszNgQ1QTBAdCKJ0v4480ei3MMbC7jQ2RCfpQGRjcPzwJIk-xdRilWS0XjM39itKR0mlQ5z7TwkXIVpSIzSbAHDCz_Tx4sXFSyejlSLLSyjEG3zI3kzjrilEMf9ERWFH_-1Bh1kSJ8ozDLt0RWoDaIQKWZvo=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R89" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">90</div></th><td class="s35">Beyond The Veil</td><td class="s50">Force Multiplier</td><td class="s33">Embers of Light</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R90" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">91</div></th><td class="s24">Ophidia Spathe</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbI_kD1z8sBUNATb628viJ_4kYL3WDU7Z-fTzH06kCvT9-uaso7c__XA7K6SWHmsO9hUnT24RimUxwmAJ71SRs65nvAYSTPeeo_Nf-Nn0pNs2nw_qjP_U4ADbk5Xkcu8njIB1xV2qAFN2tjtZxrtjUG4akut73j5pHf=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3">Grants an extra <span style="color:#79bec3;">Melee Charge </span>to <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Solar Melee Abilities.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">All Melee Charges</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> are recharged simultaneously.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does NOT recharge all Melee Charges if Melee Abilities have been used in the last ? seconds.</span><span style="color:#e06666;"><br></span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Eg: Both are recharged on </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Gambler&#39;s Dodge</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">)<br></span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#f9cb9c;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Throwing Knife Kill</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">67% | 133% | 200% Increased Throwing Knife Damage</span> for 5 seconds.<br><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Gambler&#39;s Dodge Usage</span> refreshes the duration. </td><td class="s36">One-Eyed Mask</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ6Z_yKbS6XZtzWvwCeEDyyE_Sqa5tsiy94prLq4HjVMqXbHrOphwsJ2htiPjRCNUtvnp4FGkZYP0pyyA2ffieD4Vi4_PlzxFH3J2VcSexHqS-De3n4n83oRXdpZESmcQ9NpkuTD-kc2eeDZSe0c_xRJguvHmtYACW0=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s37" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">receiving damage:<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Highlights </span>the first enemy that dealt damage for 8 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Only one enemy can be </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">highlight </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">at once.<br></span><br>Killing the <span style="color:#ffd966;">highlighted </span>enemy grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Vengeance</span>, which is a <span style="color:#7cadff;">95 HP Overshield</span>, for 6 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Enemies cannot be highlighted while Vengeance is active.</span></td><td class="s16">Rain of Fire</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ6Rt0_YrL_VIBRHwcTL30Tgu9hmGYBd6eixYeW8IS8Ug7KdkLKg-PPHwOLHtJ0oT77XOp-IZH