d class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb9jTP318B9t9zyPuSEH_BCiivMF1eoqO8VkCIyKr4Rr9qVMEaYUFl-W1LeE10KAdMbZzhizYbVF1mH-2rlKLp48qWDHtf3whKd-nKztS_lcGiY0jAFOLtOeXJSPrybFjPJ_OKjiINR6XBnKV8ztbD-nWbXEAhkMD-5=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R92" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">93</div></th><td class="s33">Scissor Fingers</td><td class="s42">Vengeance</td><td class="s23">Soaring Fusilier</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R93" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">94</div></th><td class="s28">Orpheus Rig</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbi391d5e3uh-Csyg7Zv6ZE7RyVc09chcop_1ZOjAFFuQVYvSL_RekpVZC2D4to5y0xXtNDTxsIZoYp_-Ofs9Baq27jv6kTkKMMLEDX_7wk0ZzcCjlwmr22PKoWo3mHv3aEbUb3CaQaq92QAPXNDBz7kyXfMSddG_H-=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s48" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">For each </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">enemy that gets tethered </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">to a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Deadfall anchor</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">10%</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> Grenade</span>, <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span>, and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span>Ability Energy. <span style="color:#fdd24d;"><br>Refunds X% Super Energy, up to a maximum of 50% Super Energy.</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#fdd24d;"><br></span><br><span style="color:#fdd24d;">Moebius Quiver </span>can fire an additional volley per<span style="color:#f3f3f3;"> </span><span style="color:#fdd24d;">Super Activation and lasts 4 seconds longer.</span></td><td class="s24">The Path of Burning Steps</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWqFmZZIhy9mR9wlhmcTKsc8AIwHBrhNPrXCVR3C6bF__KU_TIr8vTQa9UjFHfe_7UlNIRlZ1fV5m_d0ErcBggsycKpv7Ndl7VZ3KcIGSrKxq0nWUyFYjcwkiRtsj6mjb1m8Xl_8YeIfodmHaz3qydb_NSri00sK1Y-EA=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#e0a261;">Roaring Flame stacks</span> grant increased <span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar Weapon</span> and <span style="color:#ff9900;">Ignition </span>Damage.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Roaring Flame x1 </span>| <span style="color:#e0a261;">6% Increased Weapon Damage</span> and <span style="color:#ff9900;">15% Increased Ignition Damage</span>.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Roaring Flame x2</span> | <span style="color:#e0a261;">9.2% Increased Weapon Damage</span> and <span style="color:#ff9900;">20% Increased Ignition Damage</span>.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Roaring Flame x3</span> | <span style="color:#e0a261;">12.4% Increased Weapon Damage</span> and <span style="color:#ff9900;">24.9% Increased Ignition Damage</span>.<br><br>Halves <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Slow Stacks</span> received <span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(rounded up)</span> and they last half as long. <br><span style="color:#3d85c6;">Freeze</span>, and <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspend </span><span style="color:#c27ba0;">debuffs </span>last half as long.<br><span style="color:#3d85c6;">Stasis Breakout</span> deals no self-damage.<br>Breaking out of <span style="color:#3d85c6;">Freeze </span>or <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Suspend</span> triggers a <span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar Blast</span> that deals up to <span style="color:#e0a261;">105 Solar Damage</span> in a 9 metre radius </td><td class="s38">Rime-Coat Raiment</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXstyRzzBMqm9BtzchLf_hk5D1d89otrV8_G9qmUbuzLasycMUrd7SHjryHwgOXiwHs4WHKF2X-2QI3wRk1Rq62SN4XF0RRCZ_nVLzuIE6GBW4MkSv3OyA-m4ZSgdtf9SP8sWk0mspogWvGD2OOTQ5tOFaXefB5ZtvFhA=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s60" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Enhances Bleak Watcher:<br></span>Targeting Range is increased to 50 meters.<br>Creates <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">4 Medium Stasis Crystals</span> diagonally to where it spawns.<br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Bleak Watcher</span> emits a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Storm</span> that covers 6 meters.<br>The <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">4 Stasis Crystals</span> respawn after 15 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Crystals</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> count as </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability Damage.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While standing in the </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Storm</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Icicle </span>every second, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#ffd966;">5 stacks</span>.<br>Shooting triggers the <span style="color:#ffd966;">Icicle </span>to attack, releasing a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Projectile</span> that deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">50</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Damage </span>and inflicts <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">x50</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[x20]</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> Slow</span> for ?<span style="font-size:7pt;color:#6fa8dc;">+?</span> seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Icicle </span>can fire every 0.2 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Icicle </span>persists for 2 seconds while not in the <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Storm</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R94" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">95</div></th><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVlNWd6ejfCCeKyL-WNxsNBCXugK1j61klnPEVrOWsTvbLGh6e9dxspfABTh7cbrFR6bfP4jRJBOww4CVDdAj9qvaHbe9GAhcqAifZEo_Rqfhvdzv3YctPS-OykqQYG1cDRCgf08Ve-kbq6n6TZKY9IgJ_ZEipaKXCAow=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUdNseTFJcRBe8sctAQZe-FwfyRd-oyxQBcofy5OLTbWZ3cHTCAhQmRe_lPA5tt5DHoKCv9lqqesIJApdByNK8vhs0lKX5e_AJBFMx6NFQFbJh8YB3TY0sKGqrgr6l080XezhiMH7m_uZLJqIuwPiPiOFnP5ZD8oRkUfUo=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s41"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWt88CgxdaHG0u_RU0Qvy99KCf6nOSkHubd8yTRVP56LL0cBALm6KwArULrrHzNiz8byMTKeiKGzlVf4tghcCf8EBf26UAA0FhD9H3i1UMJsBySzx8Ej_i0WdcTlux3Jn1xZPqsqTXPJz-telOFTzuZVa4HYcYwDLp57zY=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R95" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">96</div></th><td class="s35">Uncanny Arrows</td><td class="s33">Firewalker</td><td class="s43">Bleak Domain</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R96" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">97</div></th><td class="s26">Raiden Flux</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLazwsXG82ACXDMr017-Eefrnw4rmLwjIc6XuMhWf6du8Vv9ZeY9zOAkwN0hS6xVeZ4o9xM9zuyQR70DnSBXxa3suJP0n0OtmvAvSrufqhxaO4tJR_XeCG-OZeqAJprQwPHVEBR-r4rcmiROskBzcjOQrsZjdzux5OIA=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#ffd966;">Arc Staff Hits </span>grant a stack of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Synapse Junctions</span> for 5 seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#ffd966;">3 Stacks</span><span style="font-style:italic;">.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Arc Staff damage </span>inflict <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Jolt</span>. <br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Palm Blast</span> (L-L-H) receives <span style="color:#f1c232;">1.5x</span> the damage increase.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Synapse Junction x1 =</span> 27% <span style="color:#f1c232;">(40%)</span> Increased damage and<span style="color:#ffd966;"> 20% Slower Passive Super Drain.<br>Synapse Junction x2 = </span>61% <span style="color:#f1c232;">(96%)</span> Increased damage and<span style="color:#ffd966;"> 40% Slower Passive Super Drain.<br>Synapse Junction x3 = </span>105% <span style="color:#f1c232;">(174%)</span> Increased damage and<span style="color:#ffd966;"> 60% Slower Passive Super Drain.</span></td><td class="s36">Peacekeepers</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbGog_FJRewSFDi5RPWKqmnln6MUezhQNIBTaNzmIFH65cYj0nc-VQYn-OsFspQaRqkbPzuGtZjkqV3PtCH_zRTydZ1p6l5DSB7p-TM3zChVVwkQo9LM77I83voqEQ9vj7f-2WRPiLK9A-NGeFL6Iz9DJ71BZi3CWd6=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s68" rowspan="3">Passively grants +40 Airborne Effectiveness to Submachine Guns.<br>Stowed Submachine Guns are refilled after 1.25 seconds.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Submachine</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Gun is readied:<br></span>+25 Mobility<br>+50 Handling with a 0.8?x Ready/Stow Duration Multiplier<br>33% Decreased ADS Movement Speed Penalty<br>Increases Sprint Speed from 8m/s to 8.5m/s.<br>Increases Slide Distance from 6.5 meters to 8.5 meters.<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Upon scoring a Submachine Gun Hit against a Combatant:<br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Damage Buff</span> for 1 second, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#ffd966;">20 stacks</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Damage Buff </span>grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">5% increased Submachine Gun Impact Damage against Combatants</span> per <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>.<br>Additional Submachine Gun Hits refresh the <span style="color:#ffd966;">Damage Buff duration</span>.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Bosses take 33% decreased damage from Peacekeepers buffed shots.</span></td><td class="s46">Sanguine Alchemy</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbWcrQU9fa5ElGk0aynJmhMcDJaIvVZ8PdwLtsZCKQlw8hlMiXeMzfnkrpM-cO53d5PXgKmtpGDEog8qhsO3fVsNr-0Brv0bDbu3Iox3Pwymwmr5HvxAizvC8Oa095ytFvDHsggbF90IB19_QfiVjHpIihbnstGsA=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s47" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While in a</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Rift</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Well of Radiance</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br><br></span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">x4 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super-Matching</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> Weapon Surge</span>.<br><br>Damaging an enemy applies a <span style="color:#ffd966;">mark</span> for 5 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Marked Enemies</span> receive 10% increased damage from the <span style="color:#ffd966;">user</span>.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span>Kills grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">Blood Magic </span>for 5 seconds, up to a maximum of 15 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Blood Magic</span> pauses the duration of the <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Rift </span>for as long as it is active.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Well of Radiance</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> will not be extended by </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Blood Magic</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br><br></span><span style="color:#e06666;">Swapping to </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Sanguine Alchemy</span><span style="color:#e06666;"> while in combat will disable all of its effects for 10 seconds.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R97" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">98</div></th><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUZTppLmr__XEE7aWZ-m0ui7fAniw_jL8hx2CwTErhkwVMNe0v_F_H3eVO3Dq6za_IfQZ9xC3vqFk3GEEsRbgn8le4_D3yYAybnZy9q99ujyhrlSVlSyQUvLMYLY__A5pNK1HRR-R_KfY5NllAYH9r93oJqa-EBVLlyZA=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWfgsHMa59WaY7BFlqT8Vx7JxxFAeDmvV2qru-f6E3OhIl9xWf0lUxI3GzaABIpJtmFSigO8qvVGLroj--YX_yADbPXOlCkRmOrcmnyCOCqoTfkL1b1l_c3-MLGMLmyuLdwReg1FtPfxIVSUhgtWoqu3xkJ3FJXMdxbPw=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s49"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaFsxNQs4ZwAYVws0IFCmhPSEaXCaSoUOpqBSfjGwj6yIeeW9DBJouAcOAlOA7Ol5_G_hUgAbdo46zVOIjQoFZhpvQcYs4v1ktQv1ymbiCMxS8fUp5gEXW3Wy2MY5VSOYhu5cwxh0AVB-6vps03m7jXNywUFcv5TCT_=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R98" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">99</div></th><td class="s34">Synapse Junctions</td><td class="s42">Mecha Holster</td><td class="s50">Blood Magic</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R99" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">100</div></th><td class="s26">Raiju&#39;s Harness</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLY32BC6GtMuAjaF7paXQ_LG_bHdsjD7hXbe7E8gNH-5sYIf1K2FzLAvFF3xAlRCX_UTmFGi4cJCZEKyZw3uJtWscAHiMNiBlOjTQ4YzG-GX-E13OTZVCtD6f5gq59WomqMZ13q0KefjUW8oBD7NSEypChMwT3MeR9Ug=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon casting </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Gathering Storm</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Enemies within ? meters are struck by <span style="color:#89cdd1;">lightning</span>, receiving <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">650 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> damage and becoming <span style="color:#76a5af;">jolted</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Caster </span>and<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> allies </span>within ? meters are granted <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Amplified</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Lightning Strikes </span>refund <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Energy</span> per <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc-Debuffed Enemy Hits and Kills</span>.<br>Hits: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T1 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T2 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T3 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T4</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">25?%</span><br>Kills: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T1 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T2</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T3</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T4</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span><br>Refunds up to a maximum of <span style="color:#ffd966;">50% Super Energy</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Arc-Debuffed</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> Enemy Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants<span style="color:#ffd966;"> additional Gathering Storm Super Energy</span>.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-and-File</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">1%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite </span>=<span style="color:#ffd966;"> 2.5%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Miniboss+</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">4%</span> | <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardian </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">4%</span></td><td class="s36">Peregrine Greaves</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLawsmkMX6Jxl-23C5OZJSJIWqmNvQX7-Xs280y2LuGrnY3sJ7xFXBEqvHPmdYa4LFBt-pgXUb0muMUCNiaY8GTd8Af01GZ0RuI4Nf7o3rbLEgPuWzdH0ItoJwwPH33zjXXS2GJt0wUq3Y3EL_f9Qsv757T4lv3BA-pi=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s37" rowspan="3"><span style="font-style:italic;">Passively grants +20 Airborne Effectiveness.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;">sprinting for 2 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, and </span><span style="font-style:italic;">after being airborne for 0.5 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Peregrine Strike</span> until the floor is touched. <br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Peregrine Strike:<br></span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Shoulder Charge Abilities</span> deal<span style="color:#666666;"> </span>250% increased impact damage.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Champions, Tormentors, and Minibosses instead take 550% Increased Impact Damage</span> and grant <span style="color:#89cdd1;">100% Fixed Melee Ability Energy</span> on hit.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Shoulder Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> includes </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Seismic Strike</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Hammer Strike</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, and </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Shield Bash</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br></span><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#3d85c6;">Frozen enemies</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> will not take </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">increased Melee Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> from </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Peregrine Strike</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td><td class="s28">Secant Filaments</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZEvr3aJ4Kc6fRIyQsoowu2v2QmLYoxVLkcOPYo4PeKBAww99iWZyrJ6YJSyS6KRNuM8K5ntdozUiUSjlKbqKRK47NFEGHfX-uZLWQFOltZsJ5fjn-q0oYWslPztAeH4m2Q-JUFCnES0H5TEif0QwGZBEUp_tj6-VLk=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s48" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Void </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">equipped</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, for the </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">user </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">only:<br></span>Standing on<span style="font-weight:normal;"> </span><span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Empowering Rifts</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span>created by the <span style="color:#ffd966;">user </span>grant <span style="color:#8e7cc3;">Devour </span>for 11<span style="font-size:7pt;color:#8e7cc3;">+0</span> seconds.<br>Exiting, and then re-entering the same <span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Empowering Rift</span> refreshes the duration of <span style="color:#8e7cc3;">Devour</span>.<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Secant Filaments</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d9d9d9;">&#39; </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#8e7cc3;">Devour </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d9d9d9;">can be refreshed to 11</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#8e7cc3;">+11</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d9d9d9;"> seconds.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#8e7cc3;">Devour </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is active:<br></span>Kills grant <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">10% Class Ability Energy</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#e06666;">No longer grants Overload Shots as Breaker Functionality is now intrinsic to intrinsics :^)</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R100" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">101</div></th><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXmkR_nDREEKGaDJVivPK_IiJBIe-QBvucDKQzCXixGEbuXxwMfHAkHfcNuDhMj9tuHuwmnL87-BoSXVkRXMxTZYNI6sCFzxa_uq_SWB6HKPkGGWvl4vBko1ipFlViHgwdJKxsRCexkoDaPm2wmfR83InmQ0OtVXD0974E=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXT2DPLFrLCllNHHDReJbUuj_4N_DO47H3BHMNDWcATXjGYts3riVNWTOCaQZNuhpzL-OVX0nGDwLvyUYrOhx8HB6iaRe8q1S2Um2UuZwUyaAnc4sVCbDpIBucID6Duzq5H8PaCtdLtNJVfxVHZbFoAJm6euf_zbB3GPaw=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaubhxisaiyoxrhuMVE4z6PCxD67namwAlVQdVLIxzi6LWCyOEVZhBDPJDtzRsvd2AF38FzIF7PRSVQX884zCJxoar8rJ2zRqPNRA5Ad2OOaTD6zadeHkUuGf8PFelEX9X8e27cp3PIgOCQAFpJQBxt5JkA2qeMuQ=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R101" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">102</div></th><td class="s34">Mobius Conduit</td><td class="s42">Peregrine Strike</td><td class="s35">Devouring Rift</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R102" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">103</div></th><td class="s10">Radiant Dance Machines</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVPaZteFhkZ3s4dDKSqrM5VZypJOCn8TYwK__Wyc9L5hnbKiJz86SdBpC4VucLd5nhGWc4He7Ko8N_z-7oha0iawlfyKWxnDlCIfsVywY9JP2WqnQVAT70fphBQ4qgeHtITYONQKmUQhXNFaflopR5KsGCb95eobKybY6Q=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s59" rowspan="3">Passively grants +20 Airborne Effectiveness to <span style="color:#999999;">Primary Weapons</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">For </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Primary Weapons </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while </span><span style="font-style:italic;">hipfiring</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+30 Mobility, +5 Range, +30 Stability,<br>-30?% Accuracy Cone Size, <span style="color:#f1c232;">+2?° Precision Angle Threshold</span>,<br>20% Increased Aim Assist and Damage Falloff Distance.<br><span style="color:#e06666;"> DMT, Last Word, and Tommy&#39;s Matchbook do not receive the Falloff bonuses, and receive uniquely tweaked Accuracy values. <br>Accuracy Cone values aren&#39;t testable but are high enough to effectively remove any accuracy cone growth.<br><br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Primary Weapon Kills</span> grant <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Energy</span>.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-And-File</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> = </span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">34%</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> | </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite+ </span><span style="font-weight:normal;">= </span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">100%</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> | </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians </span><span style="font-weight:normal;">= </span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">20%<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">100% Counter Progress</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> by scoring multiple </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Primary Weapon Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">6 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of each while at </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Full Class Ability Energy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span> <br><span style="color:#9fc5e8;">Rank-And-File</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">34%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite+</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">100%</span> | <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">100%<br></span>Grants an <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">additional Class Ability Charge</span>, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">2 additional</span> <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Charges</span>.</td><td class="s24">Phoenix Cradle</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbFI9q_E_wR0tAYxKYJKH4eSlBTWGkAAkU4H3yo0ZeSGZ4piKoFEg1lym7mov1-0BZ9h6vZ0cHd4zh31tgR9uHozF2vqydikQ7rs7fWCr9IOCUwI7XvGx-My5aKODY0-bH44bIQ-F49-U4H35US_5nMQE0g3vZ_X_Vu=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Sunspots </span>can affect <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies</span> <span style="text-decoration:line-through;">and be extended by dealing sustained </span><span style="text-decoration:line-through;color:#e0a261;">Solar Weapon Damage</span><span style="text-decoration:line-through;">.</span> <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Seems to not work properly without the Aspect, and only getting a maximum of 2 second extension?</span><span style="color:#e06666;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Phoenix Cradle Sunspots </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">have a white ring around them.<br><br>While the </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Sol Invictus Aspect </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is equipped:<br></span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Sol Invictus </span>from<span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Sunspots</span> lasts twice as long (5 -&gt; 10 seconds).<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon granting </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">3–5 Solar Buffs</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> to </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">allies</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Spawns a <span style="color:#e0a261;">Sunspot </span>under the user.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Simultaneous </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Solar Buffs</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> (such as throwing a </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Healing Grenade</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> at </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">2 allies</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">) </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">will count as multiple </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Solar Buff</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> applications.</span></td><td class="s28">Skull of Dire Ahamkara</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXq_JSXfagZPSsu8G33P0E0KubzB9apQfvJHtz8HbbKqeJX1ZuvCzpe0NVPxxYJGeh5ucE9Kn0pjfv7k3uJqaOWENN9ukR6jPjr8xgJ2nH0YhmHw4Gyn_A2wCR17eZif7dBXWhscPY9okQEHAL6VZe7-7vmvTFHq9rA_fk=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s29" rowspan="3">Massively Increases Damage Resist during <span style="color:#ffd966;">Nova Bomb.</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br>Begins at 99.5%, and sharply falls down to 75% near the end.<br><br></span>On <span style="color:#ffd966;">Nova Bomb Cast</span>:<br>Grants the ability to cast <span style="color:#ffd966;">Nova Bomb: Lance</span> for 5 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Nova: Lance</span> deals up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">2269 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Damage </span>over 8 meters. <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Deals up to 2950 damage against Bosses.<br></span><br>Destroying a <span style="color:#ffd966;">Nova: Cataclysm</span> with the <span style="color:#ffd966;">Lance </span>triggers a <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Nova Vortex</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span>alongside the <span style="color:#ffd966;">Cataclysmic seekers</span>.<br><span style="text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#bba5f3;"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="#rangeid=2031827128">Nova Vortex</a></span> is functionally identical to the <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super version</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Requires a minimum of 20 meters of distance to trigger.<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">A single cast of Nova Bomb deals up to ~14,500 damage against a Boss.<br></span><br><span style="color:#fdd24d;">Nova Bomb Kills refund 5?% Super Energy, up to 50% Super Energy.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#8e7cc3;">Devour </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is active:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">additional Super Energy</span> based on the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Enemy Tier</span>.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Tier 1 Combatant</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T2 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T3 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">T4</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span> | <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardian </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">?%</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Actual amount varies by </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Enemy Rank</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">. Works with any </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R103" style="h