09" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s60" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Enhances Duskfield Grenades:<br>Slowing Field </span>is granted 25% Increased Radius.<span style="color:#666666;"><br></span>Creates a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Medium Stasis Crytstal</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While inside a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Duskfield Grenade&#39;s Slowing Field</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">:<br></span>Enemies deal<span style="color:#f3f3f3;"> </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">50%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [20%] </span>decreased damage.<span style="color:#666666;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">User </span>and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>are immediately granted<span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> x1 Frost Armor.</span><br>Grants an additional <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Frost Armor stack</span> every 0.5 seconds.<span style="text-decoration:line-through;"><br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">When combined with </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Touch of Winter</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">:<br></span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Crystal Size</span> increases from <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Medium </span>to <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Large.</span><br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Slowing Field</span> radius is increased by +50%, to a total of 75% Increased Radius.</td><td class="s26">Point-Contact Cannon Brace</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV0KXdl31tAFfCfjvgdGB1qysZbxlGx3CjlxowBb7RNBmpBCUHLfvMByzil6c_oGxllA4YyoKttm_zWXG2RLS_bKebrREiwMOG_SByXxPcrVLZK4YnGYNHarX_6NP5T40MtsAIg6qfmPfvkwv5Lu8UY9yEtiiHPK5yYEzU=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s44" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Thunderclap </span>and <span style="color:#ffd966;">Lightning Strike</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> </span>Kills refund up to<span style="color:#79bec3;"> 50% </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Ability Energy.<br>On Thunderclap Usage: </span>Refunds an additional <span style="color:#89cdd1;">FPS-based Melee Ability Energy</span>.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">FPS Scaling: 30FPS = 10% Melee | 60 = 18% | 120 = 32% | 144 = 41% | 300 = ~77%<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Thunderclap Activation and Discharge</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Strikes enemies within 15 metres with <span style="color:#ffd966;">lightning</span>, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">181 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[50]</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Damage</span> and inflicting <span style="color:#76a5af;">Jolt</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Also instantly triggers </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Jolt Chain Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Lightning Damage</span> is increased by <span style="color:#ffd966;">100%</span> (<span style="color:#a4c2f4;">360</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[100?]</span>) while <span style="color:#79bec3;">Amplified.<br><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Lightning Damage</span> can be increased by up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">200%</span> by fully charging <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Thunderclap</span>. <br>Stacks <span style="color:#ffd966;">multiplicatively </span>with the <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Amplified</span> bonus, totalling <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">1080 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">lightning damage</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#79bec3;">A single fully charged Thunderclap deals 2365 damage.<br>While Amplified, this goes up to 3085 damage per usage.</span></td><td class="s70">Speaker&#39;s Sight</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXN0xSEjp7kzEKmjZcxz4JTi8dk_OqUtB4Z2gm1CRo78UIPbHxX1YuaWb79CXo3GNnkD4ibEAHpCABy4nUVXWtJzWVB0hEbRtVnWd0mV1q58R-N86EEONlo2PrqBPTfE-36N3Yr-r4KIjNsKTR20vcW9qudMtbKve1fpmk=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s17" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Healing Grenades&#39; </span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration Orb</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> </span>is replaced with a <span style="color:#ffd966;">Healing Turret</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Consuming a </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Healing Grenade</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> will spawn a </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Healing Turret </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">in front of the user.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Healing Turret<br></span>Lasts 9 seconds and has <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">100? Construct HP</span>.<br>Releases <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Healing Seekers</span> every 3 seconds towards the <span style="color:#ffd966;">user </span>and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>within 30 meters.<br><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Healing Seekers</span> bestow <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Cure x1</span> and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration x1</span> for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">4+2</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[3+1.5]</span> seconds over a 7.5m radius.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">If Touch of Flame is equipped and </span><span style="color:#e06666;">only for the wearer</span>: <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Cure </span>and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration </span>are increased to <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x2</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">restoring Health </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">once </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">[six times]</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">to a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">damaged </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Ally</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Spawns an <span style="color:#ffd966;">Orb of Power</span> that grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">2.5% Super Energy</span> on the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">ally</span>&#39;s position.<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"> Incurs a 10 second cooldown between Orb spawns.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R106" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">107</div></th><td class="s41"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUXh-Mo4MLh4zmiH4h111AYZboygJTquy84L-JjY9-dU_L9tJxQoMP6zd6qdOM4bwqxRQuI_7oF2RE3paiIzWwmxG2z65TsqWWMVidELNw4TprGg1Zml1JoFmA-KfoWpT-dwz70OVFIOZym4rG71_jfQvwXHYOxF6uBDW0=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWplKxf_abAXnAJnL-OOSEsXsl_0fWehhwIc7UUE2JBVw3O39i0lTSUy-DZBy7PsII06lysKnN1vC6RxuONUX8jSQqSGQd31MV6253Tmk67zK6ht2ZFFFSnp0iFKzG7nnkuwFzLV0SnSww3JWsEvOBGkHNE4z7wCgIqtA=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV4unwDdAtPR1NppWBBcvNTU1QK06wf6DHB4Iw5emJODe9TFDGe5TI031iJIggIgYM75v9Dvs4XCMgC-cSL6uPD8Cu6SlAg0-fZGUzXCuTVtzLlgavWxxFFMxm8lZXvIriOqSzZmG3f7b9tMud41LODy6TZgblmEHXOqw=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R107" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">108</div></th><td class="s43">Depths of Duskfield</td><td class="s34">Hammer of the Gods</td><td class="s23">The Lost Voice</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R108" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">109</div></th><td class="s10">Sealed Ahamkara Grasps</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa6plD_zILtyNg7c_Y2UTMn79mlqR7DIfdUnCqCpME0MEOru20q6f9Sn0KzbcouvZMWvs2H6rT4BVFoCM0vtYD1wloL-sNGhOO1tpx7ZYUesFdloEO1MTws5nHorkf5ggPa_uDNJTl3TRLEwMHrDu6U9-yYecjqsk4q=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s12" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Powered Melee/</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">Grapple Melee</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;"> Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#9fc5e8;">Finisher</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants<span style="color:#ffd966;"> Nightmare Fuel</span> for 7 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Nightmare Fuel |</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> 35%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[20%]</span> increased damage, +? Handling and +50 Airborne Effectiveness.<br>Refills Stowed Weapons.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Does not stack with Empowering Buffs.<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">readying </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">different weapon</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> after gaining </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Nightmare Fuel</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refreshes <span style="color:#ffd966;">Nightmare Fuel</span> duration.<br><br>Scoring a Weapon Kill while <span style="color:#ffd966;">Nightmare Fuel</span> is active retriggers <span style="color:#ffd966;">Nightmare Fuel</span>, allowing the next weapon switch to benefit from the aforementioned bonuses.</td><td class="s26">Praxic Vestment</td><td class="s71" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVwRQTaHiHETrZf7i_yxR97U7u0vKHaqoDDXuPlaChMAD7FwproYcHaSqTYt7AAhAqRfKmDPvFEMeH7Lxn_LH9jcyv3IN87B-xdjMyFoll9JxijVhw8hfURFzbIwLNqFSxRY1IjynfWnfu2Zqw71Ak7B0d4Pc3gdQAeYA=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s44" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#ffd966;">Jetpack Fuel</span>: Passively charges <span style="color:#ffd966;">3.5%/s Jetpack Fuel</span>.<br>Weapon Kills grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">20% Jetpack Fuel</span>. <br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Powered Melee Kills </span>grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">50%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">Jetpack Fuel</span>.<br>Use [Air Move] while Airborne to activate <span style="color:#ffd966;">Jetpack </span>once it is charged.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Jetpack Fuel</span> is <span style="color:#e06666;">always emptied</span> after usage.<br><br>On <span style="color:#ffd966;">Jetpack Activation</span> | Deals up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">168 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[69]</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Damage</span> over 6 meters and inflicts <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">exhaust</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Jetpack Duration </span>varies depending on whether Air Move is tapped or held.<br>[Air Move Tap] travels 30 meters over 1.5 seconds.<br>[Air Move Hold] travels 50 meters over 3 seconds.<br><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Exhaust </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">reduces Combatant Damage Output by 25%<br></span><br>Colliding with an enemy while flying triggers a <span style="color:#ffd966;">Praxic Knee</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> </span>that deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">1509 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Damage</span>, <span style="color:#999999;">blinds </span>over ? meters, and grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">+40 Melee Stat</span> for 7 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Praxic Knee benefits from </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Melee Damage Buffs</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">.</span></td><td class="s24">Starfire Protocol</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb3qKWQGT9wONtlZWR_SLV2iUX2y6DPZA78TloPz3Uk_oOD7t1CVIE1RlTyAKalhZdpj0DClLdmyDQ7Jdtz3nQjL_eACjLHU0Fg8DOXKMhkQL8nzwx3PknIeHYvNhvL3RhskTTnegptipJOBXrm_aOjuD5QFLkUzVQO=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Grants an extra Fusion Grenade Ability Charge</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">.<br><br></span>Passively grants<span style="color:#f6b26b;"> 20% Additional Base Fusion Grenade Regeneration Rate<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ae924d;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Radiant</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or in either a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Well of Radiance</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a2c4c9;">Empowering Rift</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">5% Fusion Grenade Ability Energy</span> per Weapon Hit <span style="color:#e06666;">up to once every 0.4 seconds.</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">1</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">5% Fusion Grenade Ability Energy</span> on Weapon Kill.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Fusion Grenade Kill:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">100% Class Ability Energy.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R109" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">110</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUg_dc4l1r74OW-_e7eizuBdjAY0VfDnG8Fe1dJa5sbNPmxUwpd1n-ir1kCUrUFOlMJfzbE36jnkcoagfen6DShoB3TcfJtWWjpQ9dlbMLJU0RtVVN6oQW8k51quTKvk_J4svIkGv-IY40dZynKwBNwIv7lo9qEQ76q6SM=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s72"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUx8AQHf7vNciVwbAHMjIStRahLq3Fy7FTRflv28kXAVldwX1ugryozkYch5Lsfus5IrLny087903QZx6LX6iCrE0pTBmGXaILALxYYsJ119u2eSUwQqt95wqr5do4znOg9xuxCj6R8rpYcvRfNSPPGL5Q7Uc1QwYOQlSw=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYpqEBq2WBqWKuWDSOGIuYEtO28AdwLbD_EXAUEf0Zy0bXXJT-Hfu1xBLbzLGRvBXQSs1Z_UCKgqrA3Snez6KhrTwISxway5o7Np_dH2FUTEUZvYC67UbIil2MaUDsBqwqyCCf0HGGdb5t3SKEHCOKMxuCll0RLLBop=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R110" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">111</div></th><td class="s21">Nightmare Fuel</td><td class="s34">Praxic Lift</td><td class="s33">Fusion Harness</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R111" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">112</div></th><td class="s24">Shards of Galanor</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYbpCuAtt558vjR6FPtRdkcAKZ1ery_I8GAz1gEt5wJA1S6J_IJnWI-RF_DAo1w8qy3PlVCWaGNj1fsvUvwPWpo1iDYFTztIv0oP8p7peFgvU5Zl1LGaPsbHOEjAqO8dJtQ4RModKmZ5inw4AsKnOczCxsnkphxCQ=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s52" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Solar </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Ability</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Kills</span><span style="color:#79bec3;"> </span>grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">2.5% </span>to <span style="color:#ffd966;">5% Blade Barrage Super Energy</span>, depending on <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Enemy Rank</span>.<span style="color:#ffd966;"><br><br>Blade Barrage</span> Hits and Kills refund up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">50% Super Energy. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Refund is unaffected by Super Stat.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Refund Amount</span> depends on Kills and Hits, as well as <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Enemy Rank.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Elite = ~20% | Boss = 50%<br><br>Blade Barrage Impact and Explosion Damage is increased by 25%.<br></span>Triggers a delayed <span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar Explosion </span>for each<span style="color:#f6b26b;"> 5 knives</span> landed, up to <span style="color:#e0a261;">2</span> per <span style="color:#ffd966;">Blade Barrage usage</span>.<br>Each <span style="color:#e0a261;">Explosion </span>deals <span style="color:#e0a261;">damage without falloff</span> over 10 meters and releases <span style="color:#e0a261;">4 Shrapnel</span>.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">1st Explosion</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">5852 (3804 Boss)</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Damage | 2nd Explosion = </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">6437 (4184 Boss)</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Damage</span>.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Shrapnel </span>deals up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">290 (190 Boss)</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Damage </span>over ? meters and inflicts <span style="color:#e0a261;">x20+0? Scorch</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Damage Increases</span> ONLY affect the <span style="color:#ffd966;">initial knife impact, explosion,</span> and <span style="color:#ff9900;">ignition </span>damage.<br>Results in <span style="color:#ffd966;">~140% increased damage</span> on Bosses with zero investment.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Knock &#39;Em Down increases </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Blade Barrage damage vs Boss</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> from </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">~21K</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> to </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">~26K</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> (~+25%)</span></td><td class="s46">Precious Scars</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLY9xZttEBvkfliKc2aOqEPt_KZo7SthnKgPRzO8txkMT9HkzZHzFsyCCra35WZ1XX0OUPX3HvDOiYP-xicfpU_WYeTO_tlb6iNEi_mgrBZ2bGKLy8OByWKF1_xzbZK2LPY0PVIN0k-vdiLThg6Mhf4TilzKLi1Cew=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s47" rowspan="3"><span style="font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">reviving </span><span style="font-style:italic;">an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">ally</span><span style="font-style:italic;">, or being </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">revived</span><span style="font-style:italic;">: <br></span>Projects a 15 meter field for 10 seconds that grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Wearer </span>and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Allies </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Shielded</span>.<span style="color:#9fc5e8;"><br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Allies </span>that leave the radius temporarily lose <span style="color:#ffd966;">Shielded</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Shielded</span>:<br><span style="color:#7cadff;">Overshield </span>with <span style="color:#7cadff;">100 HP</span>. <br>Regenerates over 1 second after 2 seconds of not receiving damage if <span style="color:#ffd966;">Shielded </span>is active.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Shielded </span>is removed and cannot be regained if <span style="color:#7cadff;">Overshield </span>gets destroyed.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Shielded </span>is removed from <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Allies </span>if <span style="color:#ffd966;">wearer&#39;s</span> <span style="color:#7cadff;">Overshield </span>is destroyed.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super-Matching</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;"> Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x1 Restoration</span> for 3<span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+1.5</span> seconds to the <span style="color:#ffd966;">wearer </span>and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>within 15 metres.<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 3 second cooldown between activations, displayed with the &quot;Healing&quot; buff.</span></td><td class="s16">The Stag</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYCsAdQc256CqlN8a54vtFsiP7RRfLglXqfAL52mx8PIAjgtBOTfPZH-zKnsdMXG7jQr6FZxsrBCntzMUueLGl2uLd_V3QgbrtxuEI2LNYkBdLMx4Uq5a4wQcUY7-6W5qgLTUGEINu97c0jQzoFdZU3GqVd1CEMIC-C=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s17" rowspan="3">Grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">25% </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[5%]</span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;"> </span>Damage Resist <span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Resist x2)</span> to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Guardians </span>inside <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Rifts </span>created by the <span style="color:#ffd966;">wielder</span>. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Standing in a</span> <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Rift </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">that overlaps or is inside a </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Well of Radiance</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> allows the Damage Resist to work in it.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon reaching</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Critical Health:</span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Dearly Departed</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> </span>grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">50%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [25%] </span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Energy.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Buff lasts until the user is no longer at Critical Health, essentially serving as a Cooldown.<br></span><br><span style="font-style:italic;">On Death:<br> </span>Spawns a <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Healing Rift</span> for 15 seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R112" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">113</div></th><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUGi0UyGtg5vBv0fEot0hdkbYWp5hdc5ErzHdNLPibvdwtzhzuNKFmU063Cr8KkWJYRCT2sRA4EuzvZC5UGmk6qvk0sGonFNLt6MxAfXj4KQtofPEPHZ1QIzX2P_0OFPDWg0pfkJtYgHD4hDM69jj3CHHgpOtUErrnpDZ0=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s49"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWxk2kRvVf2C4FrJtAu8xouKp7eEHx_nU_mbNvXyqTHJ9I2n_Rlp6oZOY0OBO8XDfmxzpLPdJsqTHswI4QPHa3uZZyHAjw7FaueSIh9Li-bGHxyqv2k4h3wnsAL1QQFDa4WyVkO2ojtBN1t0jOzwqast3Ed9Pvy1bolcg=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLY8XiE4rrWiVqTd81daXsCXXcpEVOWo-neTqiUoB0oM6sXy80_dElmY-rkkxr7yBsc8rlS5Ylby0BvqQEh6i4Qm07InsEV_zVE_RRPCO4rDqOTnRUUlrpWx_e_XtoeD7jHoNeZ-TFw5PZ5dnmSw1yBtSmsVZeVoXAuH=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R113" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">114</div></th><td class="s33">Sharp Edges</td><td class="s50">Kintsugi</td><td class="s23">Dearly Departed</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R114" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">115</div></th><td class="s26">Shinobu&#39;s Vow</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLakWZGob6iS_GIsdfhpzaV1JCV3q1wsG0_OhKVwfiPm4hswAB_OCza2vk4trnoNQTTZ_vmQrOnW-AaUzAYj-SHq-qIrtUgOr5a800NTX-SAaUVY1OMc8ZU49BOXmW1xpFK5APeSD3io5lNs02jKJMbRCSeTbqnrxvas=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s27" rowspan="3">Grants an extra <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Skip Grenade Charge</span>.<br>Grants <span style="color:#e0a261;">?% Skip Grenade Ability Energy</span> per <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Bolt Charge stack</span> gained.<br><br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Skip Grenades&#39; drones </span>chase enemies much more aggressively.<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Skip Grenades hits</span> grant <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">4.2%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[1.4%]</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Energy</span> and <span style="color:#89cdd1;">x1 Bolt Charge</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Counts each impact and explosion damage instances as hits.<br><br>Upon reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">x10 Bolt Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restores ? HP</span> to the user and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>within ? meters.<br>Grants <span style="color:#e0a261;">~40% Grenade Ability Energy</span>.<br>The next <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Skip Grenade</span> thrown is <span style="color:#ffd966;">enhanced</span> and bounces one additional time.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Enhanced Skip Grenades</span> release 5 additional seekers on the 1st and 2nd bounce.</td><td class="s24">Pyrogale Gauntlets</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWm3tE03ai3avk5WTU9pAaX64N8FjANGylY9XYFse4YqZA2wHsFIKxRTp0n7ZXPb3Fqlmv6AlJublV5O1v6sJxsCvc15mqa2TVjXyy6IkfhKsiS8H7HQ7x0DJVyCA8HRe-4B79ViSKyIA9vTglujfoKJgu1PC_4jLGXyio=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#ffd966;">Modifies Burning Maul into a single-use slam </span>that deals 650% increased damage, releases <span style="color:#f6b26b;">3 tracking waves</span>, but no longer counts as a <span style="color:#ffd966;">Roaming Super </span>for <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Ability Generation</span>. <br><br><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Waves </span>inflict <span style="color:#f6b26b;">x20</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+40</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Scorch</span> and create a <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Cyclone </span>on impact. <br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Burning Maul&#39;s</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Cyclones </span>deal <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">19 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[16]</span> damage every 0.2 seconds, inflict <span style="color:#f6b26b;">x?</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+?</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Scorch</span> every 0.56 seconds for 7.5 seconds, and track enemies.<br>Damage from multiple <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Cyclones </span>can now overlap. <br><br><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Consecration&#39;s second slam&#39;s middle wave </span>creates a <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Cyclone</span>, which deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">7</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[3]</span> damage every 0.2 seconds, and inflicts <span style="color:#f6b26b;">x3</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+2</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Scorch</span> every 0.56 seconds.</td><td class="s26">Stormdancer&#39;s Brace</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYT9jL9h15D0HAPOlOcxC3jqTemwEvq8-7c2VdamqH8Hz6qQGNg9vKuWqdgFD-atT-ewCV6-deap9e34aGLYK6StKNsygRf7fX2EzXSAT3dt3lV-CT4Lci5nYcPvH8qA0V80VgFm-0WMrvbIu6KHb9nmtEGMI9P4A=w54-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s44" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Cast</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Amplified </span>for 15 seconds.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Stormtrance </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is equipped:<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Stormtrance Hits and Kills</span> grant a stack of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Ascending Amplitude</span>, up to 30 stacks.<br>Decreases the <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Cost</span> of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Stormtrance&#39;s</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">Ionic Blink </span>by 50%, to <span style="color:#ffd966;">3.125%</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;"><br>Ascending Amplitude:<br></span><span style="color:#9fc5e8;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">6.7?% Increased Stormtrance Damage </span>per <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>, up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">200% at 30 Stacks</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Refunds up to 30% Stormdancer Super Energy based on the amount of Enemy Kills.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Amplified</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Ability Hits</span> grant <span style="color:#89cdd1;">x1 Bolt Charge</span> up to <span style="color:#e06666;">once every 0.6 seconds</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R115" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">116</div></th><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXMgvv6shLpHMcVFQMOyS-YH6-u7PNb2J-Jd389l7g_NDi4zYjklxYVE173GNyFSykqIsvH6HDtG8ymNRsfF5KCoNrr1QfVawEmZ6U4rJwj00KmO1PRaGdTOTJ9IRddB_mzOPNsBmZt1T-UKYr-PAZ86jI-Glh-Vls3zw=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXNJk71ynys1RDMA9in8Mlekk1Xdra1qa9EkuRsm3mGhGgQnVX11ZRY_2pPnU2kZtv38RLe3vLdvz__IG4PpLBBnZF6oKIjp0Fp8Ijpn_Uco5m1BXXVQ7H3C9dRgx8EyovJKPWm6QZTqYgy9c4Am1wOUKnhySy9JHItGtg=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLY6rKGS20lpclSbc-l7xNOMYUcJ5xzDlymIRXmph-WfvEMM0J3bRhSiZqfPi93pbffcqguCc-OcZGexxxSdC1mK-KYtAm1jl9sm5fHXtm0PgWb14VF0w297Bog6J_Nt_5rvMhWydB1K6qqs_mvTSXilgSCNCr1ECmC2=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R116" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">117</div></th><td class="s34">New Tricks</td><td class="s33">Percussive Flames</td><td class="s34">Ascending Amplitude</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R117" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">118</div></th><td class="s10">The Sixth Coyote</td><td class="s1