> without cooldown.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Void Breach Pickup</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">11.25% Shield Throw Ability Energy</span>.</td><td class="s24">Sunbracers</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbtK3bMqrAvOrQIh5To_N6XFGZM-gZlbCO3ichfrY4UB4dy0dCwZIkuBwDdQqVnMwcxyZXGKZ0pVzW2r_QI8arQg76W5IAXoixe5skWGRDq_4LlLsamHKJuvEycfUJdwlt1sbI1QCe8uOqHdjhJ-S6894hfwz2VBzbW=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">The Solar-Element Grenades named &quot;Solar Grenades&quot; have Fastball intrinsically and last 2 seconds longer.<br></span><br><span style="color:#79bec3;">Powered Melee Kills</span> grant 5 seconds of<span style="color:#f3f3f3;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Sunbracers Ready.<br></span><br><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Grenade Ability</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> Usage while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Sunbracers Ready</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> is active:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Sunbracers</span> buff for 4 seconds.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Sunbracers </span>grants <span style="color:#f6b26b;">20,000% Additional Base &quot;Solar Grenade&quot; Grenade Regeneration Rate</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R118" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">119</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWsLFaBf-_lh5hi9-6UEv25rXZd4_otV1o08FW9ZqfE_IkvofRBco6BKBfzB8NRtk6p9iJ2yEPCm0CdhCkjSAZBbzyGZzAd7xbriYusqYD2xoACyY3m9orK-Clb8VHBSAYYCg17hCuTOViKzsKNA53hzoJ59Z6S5Kyk3ks=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s32"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUyQzdjBZYZRdi4UtChHzrt3cwubI61ZhawKQ05JqJxVJUu-2J2Xhzob3vmdjobMTaXrI_67lec3_Kr9S-VzYTW26OFaSj9lEjxc6z-d8IQeHz1DPZ0GzKudVLguBMNQ-nja2RXyqVZ6rrl_NUj_AbVmdSeHXcA8xgIXkI=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbZr4x4W0pHBm7c3zkdARCVRy4WCLJpXBcEfjenlHDs0ZJnkBM7wrdAs7YUf8ZBXkCRKsuNzLWi-AGHMFkjCymfmpZLwd5gy4MDAo_YbOZjk9TuCrqNJbrUkr9GdwDu1Lo3V_RmaOtTUzL34BHtP7QExogUnshB2Qp4=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R119" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">120</div></th><td class="s21">Double Dodge</td><td class="s35">Myrmidon&#39;s Reach</td><td class="s33">Helium Spirals</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R120" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">121</div></th><td class="s10">Speedloader Slacks</td><td class="s73" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVjNN7Up6bZZJeDMza64uCyabzgHMEwj6EFoq_GrltZcz3JudNY1jKgfVP0EyZc79VO1hB0q6cs-Z6Vrz4-EfQUSwHhvx99Gpl6UUtHkrx-mK7ZdCtGH8v1YDBoadlgkOzzQ_9UxE_F55xzgaBMC7cQRJq8Tzupsfmh2_A=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s59" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br>On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Reloads all weapons and picks up <span style="color:#63d275;">Ammo </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Bricks </span>within 15 meters. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Activates On-Reload Perks.<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">x1 Tight Fit</span> for the <span style="color:#ffd966;">wearer </span>and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>within 15 meters for 15 seconds.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Tight Fit </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is active:<br></span> <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Dodges </span>grant an additional <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>, up to a maximum of<span style="color:#ffd966;"> x5 Tight Fit </span>and refresh the duration of the buff.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Allies </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within range match the stack amount of the </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">wearer&#39;s Tight Fit</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> when the buff is refreshed.<br></span><br>+40 | +40 | +45 | +50 | +55 Reload Speed<br>- | 0.925x | 0.915x | 0.91x | 0.89x Reload Duration Multiplier<br>+40? | +40? | +45? | +50? | +55? Handling<br><br>Scoring direct hits within 3 seconds of each while <span style="color:#ffd966;">Tight Fit</span> is active progresses a Counter System that grants <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">20% Class Ability Energy</span> upon reaching 100%.<br>SMG, Trace = 7.14% || Auto, MG = 8.33% || Pulse = 9.1% || Sidearm = 12.5% || HC, Scout = 16.7%<br>Sword = 20% | Bow, Glaive, GL, Shotgun, Snipers = 34%</td><td class="s36">Severance Enclosure</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ0HZlpHju94t6W9GL2tGZYngoyqFBzHfsYEFzGUUqClQG5qi2Y4b2n0ItILEHAMmX3jOlNyk_2md40R7t59e-bq_79sC6a1B0EYx773LBY8D9iSPXlz_PN-_KLwQ_L8x__LtYa1zk5xhZbgVGIr82bIB0Mc63IfA=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s68" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Powered Melee Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Finisher</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">:<br></span>Enemy triggers a <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Explosion</span>, dealing variable damage in a wide radius with falloff, knocking enemies upwards, and <span style="color:#999999;">disorienting </span>them.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Falloff decreases damage by up to 20%.</span><br><span style="font-style:italic;">Explosion Damage and Radius scale on </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Enemy Rank (Finisher). <br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 1 second cooldown between non-chaining explosions. <br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Severance Explosion Damage | Radius<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-and-File: 439 (598) </span><span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage</span> over 15 meters.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite: 598 (717)</span> <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage</span> over 20 meters<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Miniboss+: 717</span> <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage </span>over 20 meters.<span style="font-style:italic;"><br><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Severance Explosions</span> triggered by <span style="color:#79bec3;">Powered Melee Kills</span> can chain, triggering a weaker explosion that only deals up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">242 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> damage in a 8 meter radius. <span style="font-style:italic;color:#c9daf8;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Chaining Explosions do not have a cooldown but cannot simultaneously trigger multiple of them.</span></td><td class="s13">Swarmers</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVZa3fsKntb6fZ32qQiisS5d1YBu3JaLYOYcbMcr44UbJrg_Ja8WHaxA9bcN920u7UjJyrhjJbVB7xn8bgzVrNhySfE8S-oUxd7eq9OAx6IHi2tKCvBaL19io2qcLSJY7saaggqRrvKJyFdkxWdO8LPzCV8I6GU-S4IGw=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s15" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon destroying a </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;">Tangle</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><br>Spawns 2 <span style="color:#b6d7a8;">Threadlings</span><span style="color:#93c47d;">.<br><br></span><span style="color:#b6d7a8;">Threadlings </span>inflict <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Unravel</span> on hit.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R121" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">122</div></th><td class="s74"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUE0BE2QW_iysC-pezTdIpuZaeHgTJFBPVIYBxRFaG_pBADjv6cTVJpi4Ppz0n3LIoK1Kka1RRw-ojFlRuBLQhqQG3eXG2C5BIfZHDK9t_ANaLmdyA5vio718tpx4MuSVVQjzXlruCImivhGCC4q6KDsMIAxFuf24_Iw4k=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVMi0f1AIMIiBbVqPmjTjto0fFwwvx6n