reatly enhances all Jumps.</td><td class="s36">Synthoceps</td><td class="s11" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLadVQDre_v5WjieR7ahmJ9j88wXDEumCJTHrvJ4zSgXOP8JeFDUwNr93JA4iu58npkXwLO4bao9xL4v5NssFihSMuHIkdmuTgUVQw7yrrE5ExTW5KaHd8c8wJgDGeQyVVCV8mEDYI3zb2ykA1mCYKQ38QP4jXkKvN5N=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s37" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">15 metres </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e47272;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">enemies</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">: <br></span>Grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Biotic Enhancements</span>.<br>Buff lingers for 5 seconds.<br><span style="color:#b6d7a8;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Biotic Enhancements:</span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">50% Increased Super Damage.<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">165% </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[100%]</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#79bec3;">Increased Melee Damage.<br></span>+35? Handling and +35 Reload Speed.</td><td class="s16">Verity&#39;s Brow</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xW-VMGCXT4gP1WeLxujE0o7Zq-3r8WOgJjsCQlvHCAZP5DGsUFVHkiz8-1Y_ZrMEbtZzlfRbBzr-zIZZ7IdU8OefJted_bJPwOJP5wjBA2rmPq86ugK65w4yEpZiWPKADFlJFQWPJMOg0Xnu_fr52z8ZPU0i1emcLbZ3q8=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s75" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Grenade-Element </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Matching Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-style:italic;">: <br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Death Throes</span><span style="color:#f3f3f3;">,</span> up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">5 stacks</span>, increasing <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Damage</span> and granting <span style="color:#e0a261;">Bonus Grenade Ability Energy</span> per second per <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>.<br>Loses <span style="color:#ffd966;">1 Death Throes stack</span> upon expiring, rather than all of them.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Death Throes stack timer</span> begins decaying after 2 seconds of gaining a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Death Throes</span>:<br><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#ffd966;">x1</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> | </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#a4c2f4;">40%</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#ea9999;">[20%]</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e0a261;">increased Grenade Damage</span><span style="font-size:6pt;">, </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#63d275;">?% Increased Grapple Melee Damage</span><span style="font-size:6pt;">, and </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e0a261;">+0.5% Bonus Grenade Energy/s</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> for 8 seconds.<br></span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#ffd966;">x2</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> | </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#a4c2f4;">55%</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#ea9999;">[40%]</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e0a261;">increased Grenade Damage</span><span style="font-size:6pt;">, </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#63d275;">?% Increased Grapple Melee Damage</span><span style="font-size:6pt;">, and </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e0a261;">+1% Bonus Grenade Energy/s</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> for 7 seconds.<br></span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#ffd966;">x3</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> | </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#a4c2f4;">70%</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#ea9999;">[60%]</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e0a261;">increased Grenade Damage</span><span style="font-size:6pt;">, </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#63d275;">?% Increased Grapple Melee Damage</span><span style="font-size:6pt;">, and </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e0a261;">+1.5% Bonus Grenade Energy/s</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> for 6 seconds.<br></span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#ffd966;">x4</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> | </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#a4c2f4;">85%</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#ea9999;">[80%]</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e0a261;">increased Grenade Damage</span><span style="font-size:6pt;">, </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#63d275;">?% Increased Grapple Melee Damage</span><span style="font-size:6pt;">, and </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e0a261;">+2% Bonus Grenade Energy/s</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> for 5 seconds.<br></span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#ffd966;">x5</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> | </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e0a261;">100% increased Grenade Damage</span><span style="font-size:6pt;">, </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#63d275;">170% Increased Grapple Melee Damage</span><span style="font-size:6pt;">, and </span><span style="font-size:6pt;color:#e0a261;">+2.5% Bonus Grenade Energy/s</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"> for 4 seconds.<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Grenade Ability Usage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Death Throes</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is active, for 5 seconds: <br></span> Allies receive <span style="color:#ffd966;">Feel The Flame</span> while within 20 metres.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Feel The Flame</span> grants <span style="color:#e0a261;">10x Grenade Regeneration Speed.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R127" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">128</div></th><td class="s18"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXfzopiz0O2flCyITUT5ESqT4rBCB2or3Qg3orGCqmxGZGp-xfCsocqSk_eBFcB-nsAbMw6cAspEL55cwWQtVHiAj2QFeIWUEohOuuFlFLWlSQVwLsP4SFzoDYVD-MUUckI6WNEO3TouKgg4xuzn1HL27tQVxHiO4tidQ=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUvK7HSIrxY4WEz32UtcC8sN30crx6AOJhDUAbHMw4_NmH4qP0v6XP7voRcxg-ex7vUi4ZaaocnREt-TuefDz3hz9qn7fmkKBT8zRYbj-4xYVAXJpo4zmBolkS3WqazT4HljvKua9KntrpZUq9nwmNSqht0Kq0uOt2kzDI=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZTtPf3byqqwW4SKQUmfHt_G4d07LA6UzJaJlB-ms1x2yEwroSzK66E3W1N3ewXwo5xUs-RN-8Qpl8RJa3_uVp5Es5xAq-E0Qri6trgxv-zt80HhpG9S2eQSpmXsJYvTvl9pTXIBwnqKP8dBdrAByxCFqmo5bQK4u-6=w110-h69" title="Image" style="width:inherit;