4? metre radius.</td><td class="s28">Ursa Furiosa</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLY1gBlNUcAfP1Xcf9N7C-4Yh250nLIGlJEWaCWbCc1z0uQrL-v1cFaVCa_6kEG3Z6j-HUJUWsvaX6sWsK7v2rtmO-tcbI6gPWEKJCD_ppDX0aW3rtGYFdjEgYrsJcsywbHkNogH9XIuGyJQq7ac7CEy3TA2pPhh_9ID=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s48" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">guarding </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">with </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Unbreakable </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Sentinel Shield</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>15% Increased Movement Speed.<br><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"><br></span>Converts <span style="color:#ffd966;">guarded</span> damage into <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Energy</span> after <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super </span>ends, up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">50% Super Ability Energy.</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"><br></span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Unbreakable </span>grants up to <span style="color:#e0a261;">60% Grenade Ability Energy</span> once it ends.<br>Scales from <span style="color:#e0a261;">15% Grenade Energy</span>, up to <span style="color:#e0a261;">60% Grenade Energy</span> after maxing out <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Unbreakable</span>.</td><td class="s26">Vesper of Radius</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUUVQjfPo1yRhnLo-_RlRIeSHVZ0WN6f28rbz-F23jFBscqq3eaYhf6dvBBoLKs-H53G3Q4Fqr-nyjBLZGY1K4stJKSDijXQEIox3WOY-a9CRp7K0-QQy8tCsH3o4a6ZBPiDsbW7BpR7Z9koUSqO5X48UW3F