lor:#e0a261;">, and </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> Ability Damage. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#fbbdec;">Works on Prismatic for </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Solar </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#fbbdec;">too!</span><span style="color:#fbbdec;"><br></span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage</span> <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">healing </span>is <span style="color:#ffd966;">enhanced </span>and spreads to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>within 15? meters:<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x1</span> = <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x3 Cure</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x2 </span>= <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x1 Cure</span> + <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration x1</span> for 3<span style="color:#e0a261;">+1.5</span> seconds.<br> <span style="color:#ffd966;">x3</span> = <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x2 Cure</span> + <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration x1</span> for 5<span style="color:#e0a261;">+2.5</span> seconds.<br>If <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration </span>is active, then it will extend its duration by the corresponding duration.</td><td class="s13">Wishful Ignorance</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xU1fkoqKLMw7A0EbjTeKjpps-m3YoBq1dK1kj6mobb9vire5NHzglvpRsZpce0_pk3XmngvM6wKIitnVpFB1rVmFhgxwuqgkJ07hl6ja9KLqmGaq1lCsmN70ASmmiUQVbJ39Tj5osxhIF39z1DGPXTd3OpI6YUCbUtnKA=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s15" rowspan="3">Grants an additional <span style="color:#63d275;">Frenzied Blade</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Ability Charge</span>.<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">Frenzied Blade</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">Flechette Storm</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> hit:<br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Wish-Dragon&#39;s Talons</span> for 2.75 seconds, up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">3 stacks</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Can only grant 1 stack per Ability Usage.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Wish-Dragon&#39;s Talons:<br></span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">25% | 60% | 120% </span>Increased <span style="color:#63d275;">Flechette Storm</span> and <span style="color:#63d275;">Frenzied Blade</span> damage.<br><br><span style="color:#63d275;">Banner of War&#39;s Pulses</span> grant <span style="color:#89cdd1;">5% </span><span style="color:#63d275;">Frenzied Blade</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> Melee Ability Energy</span> per <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">ally </span>within 10 meters.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Wearer </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">counts as an </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">ally</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td><td class="s24">Wings of Sacred Dawn</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbzPgj50DqyF_f5Vc_MDTMSD1Ff8UaZ_HU-S7_GzcBLBJo-AjVylMFHDd6nDIOH7b_YgrP58vH73HKtEKJdV9DA5sUpN-xCjWfYwY-cYx2E_qGWsx-6B8_RVibUBb7Pkw6Rwqfwrf67xG1WN1u8QEJu3BErdAyKEZpl=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s25" rowspan="3"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Solar </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">equipped:<br></span> ADS while Airborne grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">Tome of Dawn. <br></span>Passively grants +50 Airborne Effectiveness while airborne.<br><span style="color:#f9cb9c;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Tome of Dawn: <br></span>Holds the user in place midair for 2.8 seconds. <br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Combatants are less accurate at targeting the wearer<br></span>Scoring additional hits extends the buff duration by +? seconds, up to ? seconds.<br>Grants 15% Damage Resist and 25% Flinch Resist while active.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar Weapon Kills</span> grant <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration x1</span> for ? seconds and refill stowed weapons.</td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R133" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">134</div></th><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWrO85pRAbkY9rgby8SN_KVgepdj-ZqYJDj8z_2phxMGYicarZgY5zyUi5fXTSGbmIeW7GRuW7lnwZZhOHOQ7NcZRk6xhQc0eJdHLTUnu8Z9VWwIkKI8QCe0AgDNLUXu7IQ2ysxQZwFPAHiwlIYd8vtUa3fglOJDkGcUG4=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXivdEW-vtyyYhFP__R5vfqdUeqrB33PehFtNBg8oMLoVjOpTatbaLDWgJibCpvk8dJGUGljJe7O2KhCiNpD7umwB42055XcHzBmBrmYxaVxKPuEae1SEwkyzkAV4O8lyoP0vrGNvgzUMGxM1GF5XFSqFhBJqySgrcaqH8=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ9GocZ0Sv-k6j3H6L8DAt4kV2TMlLjs5wd048-U7cDK11QI8RDMdgz2h0kp3CNKcyrAYspxSg85uSWhBV173Eb