Ability Energy.<br>The first Scorch tick from Grenade/Melee enemy will also trigger the Grenade Ability Gains.<br></span><span style="color:#e06666;">Incurs a 0.3 second cooldown between Grenade Ability Gains.<br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Crackshot Hits</span> each grant <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10%</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[?%] </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Tripmine Grenade Ability Energy.</span></td><td class="s36">Wormgod Caress</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYC_J5zglwF7SXudkieQ0cRss71jpmd1sXMRjAVqyMab9jwwC-_bsxf8x94ko2iirdl_VyJMe0Hv3ljo0mUzEai5sV6-p1HPOsFgWUE5sOMRQBH4tvsd_MBoT9fNCjEtq1VeD3izIZyIoAKHm0eglZ9V7r79wBsgUox=w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s37" rowspan="3"><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Melee, Glaive Melee,</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Finisher </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Kill:<br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Burning Fists</span>, up to <span style="color:#ffd966;">5 stacks</span>, increasing <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span> and Weapon Damage per <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>.<br>Loses <span style="color:#ffd966;">1 Burning Fists stack</span> upon expiring, rather than all of them.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Burning Fist stack timer</span> begins decaying after 2 seconds of gaining a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>.<br> <br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Burning Fists</span>:<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x1</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">80% increased Melee Damage</span> for 9.5 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x2</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">160% Melee Damage</span>, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">20% Increased Weapon Damage</span> for 10 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x3</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">240% Melee Damage</span>, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">25% </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[20%]</span> Weapon Damage for 4 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x4</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">320% Melee Damage</span>, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">30% </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[25%]</span> Weapon Damage for 4 seconds.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x5</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">400% Melee Damage</span>, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">35%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[25%]</span> Weapon Damage for 3 seconds.</td><td class="s16">Winter&#39;s Guile</td><td class="s14" rowspan="3"><div style="width:54px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXyMBN1zYWx-36A9II32scV8uQAIMzRgPu85sHO4e5sIXin3Lo7E1yKH7dvH4pdJ92--k9Ah8RIBMpAVGI9hy3nKdFW-W8zVPMzxE3thCt1K3k2aPuU6YiDua5ngrsptukpmXVw7N-c_f5b2jrH62XOFHdtjEqda_RMaco=s209-w54-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s75" rowspan="3"><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Kills</span> and <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Glaive Melee Kills</span> grant a <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Warlord&#39;s Sigil</span> for 4.75 seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#ffd966;">10 stacks</span>.<br> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Finishers </span>grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">3 Warlord&#39;s Sigil stacks</span>. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Scorch DoT Kills do not grant stacks.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Warlord&#39;s Sigil stacks </span>decay one at a time. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Finishers </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">refresh the stack duration on animation start.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">Warlord&#39;s Sigil</span> grants <span style="color:#89cdd1;">increased Melee Damage</span> per <span style="color:#ffd966;">stack</span>.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x1</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">67.5%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x2</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">122%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x3</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">166%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x4</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">202%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x5</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">228%</span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">x6</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">249%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x7</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">265%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x8</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">278%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x9</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">289%</span> | <span style="color:#ffd966;">x10</span> = <span style="color:#89cdd1;">300%<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">reaching or refreshing</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">x10 Warlord&#39;s Sigil</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Gain a <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Ability Charge</span>.<br> Grants <span style="color:#df4545;">Warlord&#39;s Fury Ready</span> for 8 seconds and <span style="color:#e06666;">cannot be refreshed by Finishers</span>.<br><span style="color:#e06666;">Not triggering</span> <span style="color:#df4545;">Warlord&#39;s Fury</span> will return the <span style="color:#ffd966;">buff </span>to <span style="color:#ffd966;">Warlord&#39;s Sigil x10</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Melee/Glaive Melee Usage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#df4545;">Warlord&#39;s Fury Ready</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is active:<br></span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">400% increased Melee Damage</span>, <span style="color:#89cdd1;">0.8x Melee Duration</span>, and <span style="color:#89cdd1;">38.4x</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">👀</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> Melee Regeneration Speed </span>for 10 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Cannot gain Warlord&#39;s Sigil while Warlord&#39;s Fury is active. Resets Warlord&#39;s Sigil to x0 stacks on buff end.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><th id="1500097863R136" style="height: 69px;"><div style="line-height: 69px">137</div></th><td class="s30"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVkdny4Y9_-NzafLqgmX78cR4N2x2szI5rBY-5fpSW83TM--tCxzG03CTKISQ34xEKZaCDVA_vZ3JsJzlkU0_qQIP8_VCWIQxBYsLmraUGIThyQJL40Hp5rQHxzfvzVyKRyZVynuOtSctQGErlAno167V-XA6k8gn5Ij6I=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s40"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVQfmD0Et4L_oaXUc3dly2ASxm0rvwcv-UD-MgSeOYs2buLN6AWu7EzG0BDF5mkEQWpM_yzr_PLfc84z7BKWI1T8anzdbm9llejGo5Dd27R6kKqg76piGAN34xmylk9LcqU_q_RbRxCr46247FpnPNbKJGOuJEStJUzXcU=s110-w110-h69" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s20"><div style="width:110px;height:69px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbI8ICLhgWMLv2noriuLgAXVQcIY1WdBZV0uZhDk2p-nyL9nmdNILralSZ0ZhYDOtoyfXMykyT0HPfj3Lcd4fC_d2bAh69hSmzXFXLQWz2DqYIeXv8hxGu6ZH3hIUPZ2k